		/* Light-theme start shift error */
		:root[data-theme="lightblue"] .start-shift-error,
		:root[data-theme="lightred"] .start-shift-error,
		:root[data-theme="lightgreen"] .start-shift-error,
		:root[data-theme="paper"] .start-shift-error,
		:root[data-theme="aperture"] .start-shift-error {
			background: rgba(225, 100, 100, 0.08);
			border: 1px solid rgba(225, 100, 100, 0.25);
		}

		/* Light-theme hint badges */
		:root[data-theme="lightblue"] .hint,
		:root[data-theme="lightred"] .hint,
		:root[data-theme="lightgreen"] .hint,
		:root[data-theme="paper"] .hint,
		:root[data-theme="aperture"] .hint {
			background: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.06);
			border: 1px solid rgba(0,0,0,0.12);
		}

		/* Mid-tone surface fixes for richer palettes */
		:root[data-theme="fireworks"] #game-container,
		:root[data-theme="verdant"] #game-container,
		:root[data-theme="easter"] #game-container,
		:root[data-theme="herbal"] #game-container,
		:root[data-theme="aurora"] #game-container,
		:root[data-theme="rustbelt"] #game-container,
		:root[data-theme="oceanic"] #game-container,
		:root[data-theme="obsidian"] #game-container,
		:root[data-theme="desertradar"] #game-container {
			background: rgba(14, 18, 24, 0.7);
			box-shadow: 0 0 24px rgba(0,0,0,0.28), inset 0 0 0 1px rgba(255,255,255,0.04);
		}

		:root[data-theme="fireworks"] .panel,
		:root[data-theme="verdant"] .panel,
		:root[data-theme="easter"] .panel,
		:root[data-theme="herbal"] .panel,
		:root[data-theme="aurora"] .panel,
		:root[data-theme="rustbelt"] .panel,
		:root[data-theme="oceanic"] .panel,
		:root[data-theme="obsidian"] .panel,
		:root[data-theme="desertradar"] .panel {
			background: rgba(16, 20, 28, 0.58);
			box-shadow: inset 0 0 16px rgba(0,0,0,0.4);
		}

		:root[data-theme="fireworks"] .panel::before,
		:root[data-theme="verdant"] .panel::before,
		:root[data-theme="easter"] .panel::before,
		:root[data-theme="herbal"] .panel::before,
		:root[data-theme="aurora"] .panel::before,
		:root[data-theme="rustbelt"] .panel::before,
		:root[data-theme="oceanic"] .panel::before,
		:root[data-theme="obsidian"] .panel::before,
		:root[data-theme="desertradar"] .panel::before {
			background:
				linear-gradient(transparent 70%, rgba(255,255,255,0.02) 70%),
				radial-gradient(circle at 20% 0%, var(--grid) 0%, transparent 55%);
		}
		/* Earth-inspired theme surfaces */
		:root[data-theme="superearth"] #game-container {
			background: rgba(18, 24, 20, 0.86);
			box-shadow: 0 0 24px rgba(0,0,0,0.42), inset 0 0 0 1px rgba(0,0,0,0.28);
		}

		:root[data-theme="superearth"] .panel {
			background: rgba(32, 41, 35, 0.82);
			box-shadow: inset 0 0 18px rgba(0,0,0,0.38);
		}

		:root[data-theme="superearth"] .panel::before {
			opacity: 0.55;
		}

		:root[data-theme="superearth"] .logbox {
			background: rgba(30, 38, 32, 0.8);
			box-shadow: inset 0 0 18px rgba(0,0,0,0.34);
		}

		:root[data-theme="superearth"] .loghead {
			background: rgba(38, 48, 40, 0.86);
			border-bottom: 1px solid rgba(0,0,0,0.38);
		}

		:root[data-theme="superearth"] .queue-section,
		:root[data-theme="superearth"] .sys-block {
			background: rgba(28, 36, 30, 0.78);
		}

    * { box-sizing: border-box; user-select: none; -webkit-tap-highlight-color: transparent; }
    html, body { height: 100%; }

    body {
      margin: 0;
      width: 100vw;
      height: 100vh;
      min-height: 100dvh;
      font-family: var(--font-body);
      color: var(--ink);
      background: radial-gradient(circle at center, var(--bg-hi) 0%, var(--deep) 100%);
      overflow: hidden;
      text-shadow: 0 0 10px var(--shadowText), 1px 0 0 var(--shadowText2);
    }

    /* Scanline Overlay */
    .crt-overlay {
      display: none;
    }

    #start-overlay {
      position: fixed;
      inset: 0;
      z-index: 220;
      display: flex;
      align-items: center;
      justify-content: center;
      background: radial-gradient(circle at center, var(--bg-hi) 0%, var(--deep) 100%);
      text-align: center;
    }
    .start-controls {
      position: absolute;
      top: calc(var(--frame-pad) + env(safe-area-inset-top) + 12px);
      right: calc(var(--frame-pad) + env(safe-area-inset-right) + 12px);
      z-index: 221;
      display: flex;
      align-items: center;
      gap: 12px;
    }
    #start-theme-select {
      padding: 6px 10px;
      background: var(--bg-hi);
      color: var(--fg);
      border: 1px solid var(--line);
      font-family: var(--font-mono);
      font-size: 13px;
      text-transform: uppercase;
      cursor: pointer;
      z-index: 222;
    }
    #start-theme-select:hover {
      background: var(--bg);
      border-color: var(--accent);
    }
    #start-theme-select:focus {
      outline: 1px solid var(--accent);
      outline-offset: 2px;
    }
    #btn-start-help {
      z-index: 221;
    }
    #btn-start-options {
      z-index: 221;
    }
    .start-card {
      width: min(420px, 82vw);
      display: grid;
      gap: 18px;
      padding: 28px 24px;
      border: 1px solid var(--line);
      background: rgba(6, 10, 8, 0.65);
      box-shadow: 0 0 30px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.45), inset 0 0 0 1px rgba(255,255,255,0.04);
    }
    .start-sub {
      font-family: var(--font-title);
      text-transform: uppercase;
      letter-spacing: 0.3em;
      font-size: 0.7rem;
      color: var(--muted);
    }
    .start-clearance {
      font-family: var(--font-title);
      text-transform: uppercase;
      letter-spacing: 0.26em;
      font-size: 0.8rem;
      color: #f8c94e;
      text-shadow: 0 0 16px rgba(248, 201, 78, 0.5);
      justify-self: center;
    }
    .start-name-slot {
      display: flex;
      align-items: center;
      justify-content: center;
      gap: 8px;
      margin: -6px 0;
    }
    .start-name-label {
      cursor: pointer;
      font-family: var(--font-title);
      font-size: 1.2rem;
      font-weight: 700;
      letter-spacing: 0.2em;
      text-transform: uppercase;
      color: var(--signal);
      text-shadow: 0 0 16px var(--glow);
      padding: 8px 16px;
      border: 1px solid var(--line);
      border-radius: 6px;
      background: rgba(0,0,0,0.4);
      box-shadow: 0 0 16px rgba(0,0,0,0.3), inset 0 0 0 1px rgba(255,255,255,0.08);
      transition: all 0.2s ease;
    }
    .start-name-label:hover {
      border-color: var(--signal);
      box-shadow: 0 0 20px var(--glow), inset 0 0 0 1px var(--signal);
    }
    .start-name-slot.editing .start-name-label {
      display: none;
    }
    .start-name-input {
      display: none;
      min-width: 200px;
      font-size: 1rem;
      letter-spacing: 0.16em;
      text-transform: uppercase;
      text-align: center;
      background: rgba(0,0,0,0.5);
      border: 1px solid var(--signal);
      color: var(--signal);
      padding: 8px 16px;
      scroll-margin-bottom: 20px;
      border-radius: 6px;
      outline: none;
      box-shadow: 0 0 16px var(--glow);
      font-family: var(--font-title);
      font-weight: 700;
    }
    .start-name-slot.editing .start-name-input {
      display: inline-block;
    }
    #btn-start {
      font-size: 1.05rem;
      letter-spacing: 0.3em;
      padding: 14px 16px;
    }
    #btn-data-reset {
      display: none;
      font-size: 0.75rem;
      letter-spacing: 0.2em;
      padding: 8px 12px;
      margin-top: 12px;
      background: rgba(139, 0, 0, 0.3);
      border-color: rgba(200, 50, 50, 0.6);
      color: rgba(255, 100, 100, 0.9);
    }
    #btn-data-reset:hover {
      background: rgba(139, 0, 0, 0.5);
      border-color: rgba(255, 80, 80, 0.8);
      color: rgba(255, 120, 120, 1);
      box-shadow: 0 0 20px rgba(255, 0, 0, 0.4);
    }
    #btn-data-reset.visible {
      display: block;
    }
    body.start-loading #btn-data-reset {
      display: none;
    }
    body.start-loading #btn-start-resume {
      display: none;
    }
    body.start-loading .start-name-label {
      display: none;
    }
    .start-shift-error {
      font-size: 0.75rem;
      text-transform: uppercase;
      letter-spacing: 0.12em;
      font-family: var(--font-title);
      color: var(--alert);
      text-align: center;
      min-height: 1.2em;
      padding: 8px 12px;
      margin: 4px 0;
      display: block;
      width: 100%;
      background: rgba(225, 100, 100, 0.1);
      border: 1px solid rgba(225, 100, 100, 0.3);
      border-radius: 4px;
      box-sizing: border-box;
    }
    .start-shift-error:empty {
      display: none;
    }
    body.start-loading .start-shift-error {
      display: none;
    }
    .start-loading-text {
      display: none;
      font-family: var(--font-title);
      text-transform: uppercase;
      letter-spacing: 0.3em;
      font-size: 0.7rem;
      color: var(--muted);
      margin-bottom: 4px;
    }
    body.start-loading .start-loading-text {
      display: block;
    }
    .start-loading-dots::after {
      content: '';
      animation: loadingDots 1.5s steps(4, end) infinite;
    }
    @keyframes loadingDots {
      0%, 24.99% { content: ''; }
      25%, 49.99% { content: '.'; }
      50%, 74.99% { content: '..'; }
      75%, 100% { content: '...'; }
    }
    .start-status {
      display: none;
      font-size: 1.05rem;
      letter-spacing: 0.3em;
      padding: 14px 16px;
      border: 1px solid var(--line);
      color: var(--signal);
    }
    .start-progress {
      width: 100%;
      height: 8px;
      border: 1px solid var(--line);
      background: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.25);
      overflow: hidden;
      opacity: 0;
      transform: translateY(6px);
      transition: opacity 0.4s ease, transform 0.4s ease;
    }
    .start-progress-fill {
      height: 100%;
      width: 0%;
      background: linear-gradient(90deg, transparent 0%, var(--signal) 45%, rgba(255,255,255,0.6) 70%, var(--signal) 100%);
      box-shadow: 0 0 12px var(--glow);
    }
    body.start-loading .start-progress {
      opacity: 1;
      transform: translateY(0);
    }
    body.start-loading #btn-start {
      display: none;
    }
    body.start-loading .start-status {
      display: block;
    }
    body.start-loading .start-progress-fill {
      animation: startFill 8s linear forwards;
    }
    @keyframes startFill {
      0% { width: 0%; }
      100% { width: 100%; }
    }
    body.started #start-overlay {
      display: none;
    }
    body.started #start-theme-select {
      display: none;
    }
    body:not(.started) #theme-select {
      display: none;
    }

    #severed-overlay {
      position: fixed;
      inset: 0;
      background: radial-gradient(circle at top, rgba(20,10,12,0.98) 0%, #000 70%);
      color: #f5f1e8;
      display: none;
      align-items: center;
      justify-content: center;
      text-align: center;
      z-index: 200;
      font-family: var(--font-title);
      text-transform: uppercase;
      letter-spacing: 0.18em;
      padding: 24px;
    }
    .severed-card {
      width: min(720px, 94vw);
      max-height: calc(100dvh - 48px);
      border: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.12);
      background: rgba(10,6,8,0.92);
      box-shadow: 0 0 30px rgba(0,0,0,0.7), inset 0 0 0 1px rgba(255,255,255,0.05);
      padding: 28px;
      display: flex;
      flex-direction: column;
      gap: 18px;
    }
    .severed-title { font-size: clamp(1.1rem, 2.4vw, 1.5rem); letter-spacing: 0.28em; }
    .severed-sub { font-size: 0.7rem; color: rgba(245,241,232,0.65); letter-spacing: 0.24em; }
    .severed-stats-container {
      overflow-y: auto;
      overflow-x: hidden;
      min-height: 0;
      flex: 1;
      display: grid;
      gap: 18px;
    }
    .severed-grid {
      display: grid;
      grid-template-columns: repeat(2, minmax(0, 1fr));
      gap: 14px 18px;
      font-family: var(--font-body);
      letter-spacing: 0.08em;
      text-transform: none;
    }
    .severed-stat {
      border: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.08);
      background: rgba(255,255,255,0.03);
      padding: 10px 12px;
      display: grid;
      gap: 6px;
    }
    .severed-stat .label {
      font-size: 0.6rem;
      color: rgba(245,241,232,0.6);
      text-transform: uppercase;
      letter-spacing: 0.22em;
      font-family: var(--font-title);
    }
    .severed-stat .value {
      font-size: 0.95rem;
      color: #fff;
      letter-spacing: 0.12em;
    }
    .severed-actions { display: flex; justify-content: center; }
    .severed-actions button { min-width: 200px; }
    body.severed #severed-overlay { display: flex; }

    #host-disconnect-overlay {
      position: fixed;
      inset: 0;
      background: radial-gradient(circle at center, var(--bg-hi) 0%, var(--deep) 100%);
      color: var(--ink);
      display: none;
      align-items: center;
      justify-content: center;
      text-align: center;
      z-index: 200;
      font-family: var(--font-title);
      text-transform: uppercase;
      letter-spacing: 0.18em;
      padding: 24px;
    }
    .host-disconnect-card {
      width: min(600px, 94vw);
      border: 1px solid var(--line);
      background: var(--deep);
      box-shadow: 0 0 30px var(--glow), inset 0 0 0 1px var(--line);
      padding: 40px 28px;
      display: grid;
      gap: 24px;
    }
    .host-disconnect-title {
      font-size: clamp(1.2rem, 2.8vw, 1.8rem);
      letter-spacing: 0.28em;
      color: var(--signal);
    }
    .host-disconnect-sub {
      font-size: 0.8rem;
      color: var(--muted);
      letter-spacing: 0.24em;
      margin-top: -8px;
    }
    .host-disconnect-actions {
      display: flex;
      justify-content: center;
      margin-top: 8px;
    }
    .host-disconnect-actions button { min-width: 240px; }
    body.host-disconnected #host-disconnect-overlay { display: flex; }

    #shiftcomplete-overlay {
      position: fixed;
      inset: 0;
      background: radial-gradient(circle at center, var(--bg-hi) 0%, var(--deep) 100%);
      color: var(--ink);
      display: none;
      align-items: center;
      justify-content: center;
      text-align: center;
      z-index: 190;
      font-family: var(--font-title);
      text-transform: uppercase;
      letter-spacing: 0.18em;
      padding: 24px;
    }
    .shiftcomplete-card {
      width: min(720px, 94vw);
      border: 1px solid var(--line);
      background: rgba(13, 10, 13, 0.85);
      box-shadow: 0 0 40px var(--glow), inset 0 0 0 1px var(--line);
      padding: 28px;
      display: grid;
      gap: 18px;
    }
    .shiftcomplete-title {
      font-size: clamp(1.1rem, 2.4vw, 1.5rem);
      letter-spacing: 0.28em;
      color: var(--signal);
      text-shadow: 0 0 16px var(--glow);
    }
    .shiftcomplete-sub {
      font-size: 0.7rem;
      color: var(--muted);
      letter-spacing: 0.24em;
    }
    .shiftcomplete-grid {
      display: grid;
      grid-template-columns: repeat(2, minmax(0, 1fr));
      gap: 14px 18px;
      font-family: var(--font-body);
      letter-spacing: 0.08em;
      text-transform: none;
    }
    .shiftcomplete-stat {
      border: 1px solid var(--line);
      background: color-mix(in srgb, var(--signal) 3%, transparent);
      padding: 10px 12px;
      display: grid;
      gap: 6px;
    }
    .shiftcomplete-stat .label {
      font-size: 0.6rem;
      color: var(--muted);
      text-transform: uppercase;
      letter-spacing: 0.22em;
      font-family: var(--font-title);
    }
    .shiftcomplete-stat .value {
      font-size: 0.95rem;
      color: var(--signal);
      letter-spacing: 0.12em;
    }
    .shiftcomplete-actions {
      display: flex;
      justify-content: center;
      gap: 12px;
      flex-wrap: wrap;
    }
    .shiftcomplete-actions button {
      min-width: 180px;
    }
    body.shiftcomplete #shiftcomplete-overlay { display: flex; }

    #confirm-reset-overlay {
      position: fixed;
      inset: 0;
      display: none;
      align-items: center;
      justify-content: center;
      background: radial-gradient(circle at center, rgba(10, 6, 8, 0.92) 0%, rgba(0,0,0,0.98) 70%);
      z-index: 240;
    }
    body.resetting #confirm-reset-overlay { display: flex; }

    #confirm-data-reset-overlay {
      position: fixed;
      inset: 0;
      display: none;
      align-items: center;
      justify-content: center;
      background: radial-gradient(circle at center, rgba(10, 6, 8, 0.92) 0%, rgba(0,0,0,0.98) 70%);
      z-index: 230;
    }
    body.data-resetting #confirm-data-reset-overlay { display: flex; }

    #confirm-full-reset-overlay {
      position: fixed;
      inset: 0;
      display: none;
      align-items: center;
      justify-content: center;
      background: radial-gradient(circle at center, rgba(20, 6, 8, 0.95) 0%, rgba(0,0,0,0.98) 70%);
      z-index: 250;
    }
    body.full-resetting #confirm-full-reset-overlay { display: flex; }

    #confirm-clearance-overlay {
      position: fixed;
      inset: 0;
      display: none;
      align-items: center;
      justify-content: center;
      background: radial-gradient(circle at center, rgba(16, 12, 4, 0.92) 0%, rgba(0,0,0,0.98) 70%);
      z-index: 245;
    }
    body.clearance-upgrading #confirm-clearance-overlay { display: flex; }

    .confirm-card {
      width: min(560px, 92vw);
      border: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.12);
      background: rgba(6, 8, 10, 0.94);
      box-shadow: 0 0 30px rgba(0,0,0,0.7), inset 0 0 0 1px rgba(255,255,255,0.05);
      padding: 22px 20px;
      display: grid;
      gap: 14px;
      border-radius: 8px;
    }
    .confirm-title {
      font-family: var(--font-title);
      color: var(--signal);
      text-transform: uppercase;
      letter-spacing: 0.18em;
      font-size: clamp(0.95rem, 2.2vmin, 1.15rem);
    }
    .confirm-body {
      font-size: clamp(0.78rem, 1.8vmin, 0.95rem);
      color: var(--ink);
      letter-spacing: 0.04em;
      line-height: 1.6;
    }
    .confirm-actions {
      display: flex;
      justify-content: flex-end;
      gap: 10px;
      flex-wrap: wrap;
    }
    .confirm-actions button {
      min-width: 120px;
      text-transform: uppercase;
      letter-spacing: 0.12em;
    }

    /* Break Modal */
    #break-modal-overlay {
      position: fixed;
      inset: 0;
      display: none;
      align-items: center;
      justify-content: center;
      background: radial-gradient(circle at center, rgba(10, 6, 8, 0.92) 0%, rgba(0,0,0,0.98) 70%);
      z-index: 210;
    }
    body.break-modal-open #break-modal-overlay { display: flex; }

    .break-modal-card {
      max-width: 600px;
    }
    .break-modal-body p {
      margin: 0 0 12px 0;
    }
    .break-duration-buttons {
      display: flex;
      gap: 10px;
      flex-wrap: wrap;
      justify-content: center;
      margin: 16px 0;
    }
    .break-duration-btn {
      min-width: 90px;
      padding: 12px 16px;
      font-size: 0.85rem;
      text-transform: uppercase;
      letter-spacing: 0.12em;
      background: rgba(var(--signal-rgb, 100, 180, 255), 0.15);
      border: 1px solid rgba(var(--signal-rgb, 100, 180, 255), 0.3);
      color: var(--signal);
      cursor: pointer;
      transition: all 0.15s;
    }
    .break-duration-btn:hover {
      background: rgba(var(--signal-rgb, 100, 180, 255), 0.25);
      border-color: var(--signal);
    }
    .break-duration-btn:disabled {
      opacity: 0.4;
      cursor: not-allowed;
      background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.05);
      border-color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.1);
      color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.3);
    }
    .break-cost {
      font-size: 0.7rem;
      opacity: 0.7;
    }
    .break-error {
      color: #ff4444;
      font-size: 0.85rem;
      text-align: center;
      margin-top: 12px;
      padding: 8px;
      background: rgba(255, 68, 68, 0.1);
      border: 1px solid rgba(255, 68, 68, 0.3);
      border-radius: 4px;
    }

    /* Shift Time Modal */
    #shift-time-modal-overlay {
      position: fixed;
      inset: 0;
      display: none;
      align-items: center;
      justify-content: center;
      background: radial-gradient(circle at center, rgba(10, 6, 8, 0.92) 0%, rgba(0,0,0,0.98) 70%);
      z-index: 225;
      padding: clamp(10px, 4vmin, 24px);
    }
    body.shift-time-modal-open #shift-time-modal-overlay { display: flex; }
    #shift-time-modal-overlay .confirm-card {
      max-height: calc(100vh - 24px);
      max-height: calc(100dvh - 24px);
      overflow-y: auto;
    }

    .shift-time-presets {
      display: flex;
      gap: 10px;
      flex-wrap: wrap;
      justify-content: center;
      margin: 16px 0;
    }

    .shift-time-preset-btn {
      min-width: 90px;
      padding: 12px 16px;
      font-size: 0.85rem;
      text-transform: uppercase;
      letter-spacing: 0.12em;
      background: rgba(var(--signal-rgb, 100, 180, 255), 0.15);
      border: 1px solid rgba(var(--signal-rgb, 100, 180, 255), 0.3);
      color: var(--signal);
      cursor: pointer;
      transition: all 0.15s;
      border-radius: var(--radius);
    }
    .shift-time-preset-btn:hover {
      background: rgba(var(--signal-rgb, 100, 180, 255), 0.25);
      border-color: var(--signal);
    }
    .shift-time-preset-btn.selected {
      background: rgba(var(--signal-rgb, 100, 180, 255), 0.35);
      border-color: var(--signal);
    }

    .shift-time-preset-wrapper {
      display: flex;
      flex-direction: column;
      align-items: center;
      gap: 4px;
    }

    .shift-time-preset-subtext {
      font-size: 0.65rem;
      opacity: 0.7;
      text-transform: none;
      letter-spacing: 0.05em;
      text-align: center;
      max-width: 200px;
      line-height: 1.3;
    }

    .shift-time-custom {
      margin: 20px 0 16px 0;
      padding: 16px;
      background: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.2);
      border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08);
      border-radius: var(--radius);
    }

    .shift-time-custom-label {
      font-size: 0.75rem;
      text-transform: uppercase;
      letter-spacing: 0.12em;
      color: var(--signal);
      margin-bottom: 12px;
      text-align: center;
    }

    .shift-time-custom-input-wrapper {
      display: flex;
      align-items: center;
      justify-content: center;
      gap: 8px;
    }

    .shift-time-custom-input {
      width: 60px;
      padding: 10px;
      font-family: var(--font-title);
      font-size: 1.1rem;
      text-align: center;
      background: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.4);
      border: 1px solid rgba(var(--signal-rgb, 100, 180, 255), 0.3);
      color: var(--signal);
      border-radius: var(--radius);
      transition: all 0.15s;
      scroll-margin-bottom: 20px;
    }
    .shift-time-custom-input:focus {
      outline: none;
      border-color: var(--signal);
      background: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.5);
    }
    .shift-time-custom-input::placeholder {
      color: rgba(var(--signal-rgb, 100, 180, 255), 0.3);
    }

    .shift-time-custom-separator {
      font-size: 0.9rem;
      color: var(--signal);
      opacity: 0.6;
    }

    .shift-time-error {
      color: #ff4444;
      font-size: 0.8rem;
      text-align: center;
      margin-top: 12px;
      min-height: 1.2em;
    }

    #btn-shift-time {
      display: none;
    }
    #btn-shift-time.visible {
      display: block;
    }

    /* Break Screen */
    #break-screen-overlay {
      position: fixed;
      inset: 0;
      background: radial-gradient(circle at center, var(--bg-hi) 0%, var(--deep) 100%);
      color: var(--ink);
      display: none;
      align-items: center;
      justify-content: center;
      text-align: center;
      z-index: 220;
      font-family: var(--font-title);
      text-transform: uppercase;
      letter-spacing: 0.18em;
      padding: 24px;
    }
    body.on-break #break-screen-overlay { display: flex; }

    .break-screen-card {
      display: grid;
      gap: 24px;
      align-items: center;
    }
    .break-screen-title {
      font-size: clamp(2rem, 8vw, 4rem);
      letter-spacing: 0.3em;
      color: var(--signal);
      text-shadow: 0 0 20px var(--glow);
    }
    .break-screen-timer {
      font-size: clamp(3rem, 12vw, 6rem);
      letter-spacing: 0.1em;
      color: var(--signal);
      text-shadow: 0 0 30px var(--glow);
      font-family: var(--font-mono);
    }
    .break-screen-sub {
      font-size: 0.9rem;
      color: var(--muted);
      letter-spacing: 0.24em;
    }

    /* Container - full screen */
    #game-container {
      position: relative;
      z-index: 1;
      width: 100vw;
      height: 100dvh;
      padding:
        calc(var(--frame-pad) + env(safe-area-inset-top))
        calc(var(--frame-pad) + env(safe-area-inset-right))
        calc(var(--frame-pad) + env(safe-area-inset-bottom))
        calc(var(--frame-pad) + env(safe-area-inset-left));
      border: 1px solid var(--line);
      background: rgba(13, 10, 13, 0.85);
      border-radius: 0;
      box-shadow: 0 0 24px rgba(0,0,0,0.8), inset 0 0 0 1px rgba(255,255,255,0.06);
      display: grid;
      grid-template-rows: auto minmax(0, 1fr) auto;
      gap: var(--interface-gap);
      overflow: hidden;
    }

    header {
      display: flex;
      justify-content: space-between;
      align-items: flex-end;
      border-bottom: 1px solid var(--line);
      padding-bottom: 12px;
      gap: 12px;
      flex-wrap: wrap;
      transition: padding 0.2s ease, border-bottom-width 0.2s ease;
      position: relative;
    }

    header.header-collapsed {
      padding-bottom: 0;
      border-bottom-width: 0;
    }

    header.header-collapsed .brand,
    header.header-collapsed .header-right {
      display: none;
    }

    .header-toggle-btn {
      border: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.08);
      padding: 4px 8px;
      border-radius: 999px;
      color: var(--muted);
      background: rgba(0,0,0,0.18);
      font-size: 0.74rem;
      letter-spacing: 0.16em;
      text-transform: uppercase;
      cursor: pointer;
      transition: all 0.2s ease;
      white-space: nowrap;
    }

    .header-toggle-btn:hover {
      background: rgba(0,0,0,0.3);
      border-color: rgba(255,255,255,0.12);
      color: var(--ink);
    }

    .header-collapse-btn {
      font-size: 0.7rem;
      padding: 3px 7px;
      opacity: 0.7;
    }

    .header-collapse-btn:hover {
      opacity: 1;
    }

    /* Footer toggle button always visible */
    #header-expand-btn {
      display: inline-block;
    }

    /* Both fullscreen buttons always visible */
    #btn-fullscreen-footer {
      display: inline-block;
    }

    .brand { display: grid; gap: 6px; min-width: min(520px, 100%); }

    /* breadcrumb navigation - keep your pattern */
    .breadcrumbs {
      font-size: clamp(0.6rem, 1.6vmin, 0.72rem);
      letter-spacing: 0.2em;
      text-transform: uppercase;
      color: var(--muted);
      border: 1px solid var(--line);
      padding: clamp(4px, 1.2vmin, 6px) clamp(6px, 2vmin, 10px);
      border-radius: var(--radius);
      width: fit-content;
      background: rgba(13, 10, 13, 0.75);
      box-shadow: inset 0 0 12px rgba(255,255,255,0.05);
      display: flex;
      flex-wrap: wrap;
      gap: 8px;
      align-items: center;
    }
    .breadcrumbs a { color: var(--signal); text-decoration: none; }
    .breadcrumbs a:hover { text-decoration: underline; }

    h1 {
      font-family: var(--font-title);
      margin: 0;
      color: var(--signal);
      text-transform: uppercase;
      font-size: clamp(1.05rem, 2.6vmin, 1.5rem);
      letter-spacing: 0.1em;
      text-shadow: 0 0 12px var(--glow);
    }

    .sub { font-size: 0.75rem; color: var(--muted); }

    .header-right {
      display: grid;
      gap: 8px;
      justify-items: end;
      min-width: 0;
      flex: 1 1 auto;
      position: relative;
    }

    .controls {
      display: flex;
      gap: 10px;
      align-items: center;
      flex-wrap: wrap;
      justify-content: flex-end;
    }

    .help-panel {
      position: fixed;
      inset:
        calc(var(--frame-pad) + env(safe-area-inset-top))
        calc(var(--frame-pad) + env(safe-area-inset-right))
        calc(var(--frame-pad) + env(safe-area-inset-bottom))
        calc(var(--frame-pad) + env(safe-area-inset-left));
      border: 1px solid var(--line);
      background: rgba(6, 10, 12, 0.96);
      border-radius: 6px;
      box-shadow: 0 0 32px rgba(0,0,0,0.75), inset 0 0 0 1px rgba(255,255,255,0.05);
      padding: 16px;
      display: grid;
      grid-template-rows: auto minmax(0, 1fr) auto;
      gap: 12px;
      opacity: 0;
      transform: translateY(-6px);
      pointer-events: none;
      transition: opacity 0.18s ease, transform 0.18s ease;
      z-index: 240;
    }
    .help-panel.open {
      opacity: 1;
      transform: translateY(0);
      pointer-events: auto;
    }
    .help-head {
      display: grid;
      gap: 4px;
      border-bottom: 1px dashed var(--line);
      padding-bottom: 8px;
    }
    .help-title {
      font-family: var(--font-title);
      letter-spacing: 0.14em;
      text-transform: uppercase;
      color: var(--signal);
      font-size: clamp(0.78rem, 1.6vmin, 0.95rem);
    }
    .help-sub {
      font-size: clamp(0.62rem, 1.3vmin, 0.78rem);
      letter-spacing: 0.16em;
      text-transform: uppercase;
      color: var(--muted);
    }
    .help-body {
      display: grid;
      gap: 12px;
      font-size: clamp(0.82rem, 1.8vmin, 0.96rem);
      line-height: 1.6;
      overflow: auto;
      padding-right: 6px;
      font-family: var(--font-body);
      letter-spacing: 0.01em;
    }
    .help-section {
      border: 1px solid var(--line);
      border-radius: 6px;
      background: rgba(0,0,0,0.22);
      padding: 10px;
      display: grid;
      gap: 10px;
    }
    .help-section-title {
      font-family: var(--font-title);
      letter-spacing: 0.2em;
      text-transform: uppercase;
      color: var(--signal);
      font-size: clamp(0.62rem, 1.3vmin, 0.72rem);
    }
    .help-row {
      display: grid;
      grid-template-columns: minmax(120px, 160px) 1fr;
      gap: 10px;
      align-items: start;
    }
    .help-key {
      font-family: var(--font-title);
      letter-spacing: 0.12em;
      text-transform: uppercase;
      color: var(--muted);
      font-size: clamp(0.62rem, 1.2vmin, 0.72rem);
    }
    .help-list {
      margin: 0;
      padding-left: 18px;
      display: grid;
      gap: 4px;
    }
    .help-list li { margin: 0; }
    @media (max-width: 760px) {
      .help-row { grid-template-columns: 1fr; }
    }
    .help-actions {
      display: flex;
      justify-content: flex-end;
    }

    /* Profile Achievement Card */
    .achievement-card {
      background: rgba(0,0,0,0.4);
      border: 1px solid var(--line);
      border-radius: var(--radius);
      padding: 12px;
      display: grid;
      grid-template-columns: auto 1fr auto;
      gap: 12px;
      align-items: center;
      transition: all 0.2s ease;
    }

    .achievement-card.unlocked {
      background: rgba(77, 255, 154, 0.08);
      border-color: var(--signal);
    }

    .achievement-card.locked {
      opacity: 0.5;
    }

    .achievement-icon {
      font-size: 1.8em;
      width: 48px;
      height: 48px;
      display: flex;
      align-items: center;
      justify-content: center;
      background: rgba(0,0,0,0.6);
      border-radius: var(--radius);
      border: 1px solid var(--line);
    }

    .achievement-card.unlocked .achievement-icon {
      background: rgba(77, 255, 154, 0.15);
      border-color: var(--signal);
    }

    .achievement-info {
      display: flex;
      flex-direction: column;
      gap: 4px;
    }

    .achievement-name {
      font-weight: 700;
      font-size: 0.95em;
      color: var(--ink);
      letter-spacing: 0.05em;
    }

    .achievement-description {
      font-size: 0.8em;
      color: var(--muted);
    }

    .achievement-tier {
      font-size: 0.7em;
      padding: 2px 8px;
      border-radius: 2px;
      text-transform: uppercase;
      font-weight: 700;
      letter-spacing: 0.08em;
      text-align: center;
      white-space: nowrap;
    }

    .achievement-tier.bronze {
      background: rgba(205, 127, 50, 0.2);
      color: #cd7f32;
      border: 1px solid rgba(205, 127, 50, 0.4);
    }

    .achievement-tier.silver {
      background: rgba(192, 192, 192, 0.2);
      color: #c0c0c0;
      border: 1px solid rgba(192, 192, 192, 0.4);
    }

    .achievement-tier.gold {
      background: rgba(255, 215, 0, 0.2);
      color: #ffd700;
      border: 1px solid rgba(255, 215, 0, 0.4);
    }

    .achievement-progress {
      width: 100%;
      height: 4px;
      background: rgba(0,0,0,0.6);
      border-radius: 2px;
      margin-top: 6px;
      overflow: hidden;
    }

    .achievement-progress-bar {
      height: 100%;
      background: var(--signal);
      border-radius: 2px;
      transition: width 0.3s ease;
    }

    .achievement-progress-text {
      font-size: 0.7em;
      color: var(--muted);
      margin-top: 4px;
    }
    .achievement-progress-group {
      display: flex;
      flex-direction: column;
      gap: 6px;
      margin-top: 6px;
    }

    /* Theme Gallery Card */
    .theme-card {
      background: rgba(0,0,0,0.4);
      border: 1px solid var(--line);
      border-radius: var(--radius);
      padding: 12px;
      text-align: center;
      font-size: 0.85em;
      color: var(--ink);
      text-transform: uppercase;
      letter-spacing: 0.05em;
      transition: all 0.2s ease;
    }

    .theme-card.locked {
      opacity: 0.3;
      color: var(--muted);
    }

    .theme-card:not(.locked):hover {
      background: rgba(77, 255, 154, 0.1);
      border-color: var(--signal);
      cursor: pointer;
    }

    .theme-card.active {
      border-color: var(--signal);
      box-shadow: 0 0 0 1px var(--signal);
      background: rgba(77, 255, 154, 0.12);
    }

    :root[data-theme="lightblue"] .theme-card,
    :root[data-theme="lightred"] .theme-card,
    :root[data-theme="lightgreen"] .theme-card,
    :root[data-theme="paper"] .theme-card,
    :root[data-theme="aperture"] .theme-card {
      background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.75);
    }

    :root[data-theme="lightblue"] .theme-card:not(.locked):hover,
    :root[data-theme="lightred"] .theme-card:not(.locked):hover,
    :root[data-theme="lightgreen"] .theme-card:not(.locked):hover,
    :root[data-theme="paper"] .theme-card:not(.locked):hover,
    :root[data-theme="aperture"] .theme-card:not(.locked):hover {
      background: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.05);
    }

    :root[data-theme="lightblue"] .theme-card.active,
    :root[data-theme="lightred"] .theme-card.active,
    :root[data-theme="lightgreen"] .theme-card.active,
    :root[data-theme="paper"] .theme-card.active,
    :root[data-theme="aperture"] .theme-card.active {
      background: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.08);
    }

    /* New Achievement Unlock Display (in shift complete overlay) */
    .shiftcomplete-achievements {
      margin: 15px 0;
      padding: 15px;
      border: 2px solid var(--stat);
      background: rgba(210, 169, 90, 0.1);
      border-radius: var(--radius);
    }

    .shiftcomplete-achievement-title {
      font-weight: bold;
      font-size: 1.1em;
      margin-bottom: 10px;
      color: var(--stat);
      text-align: center;
      font-family: var(--font-title);
      letter-spacing: 0.1em;
      text-transform: uppercase;
    }

    .shiftcomplete-achievement-item {
      display: flex;
      align-items: center;
      gap: 12px;
      padding: 8px;
      background: rgba(0,0,0,0.4);
      border-radius: var(--radius);
      margin-bottom: 8px;
    }

    .shiftcomplete-achievement-icon {
      font-size: 1.5em;
    }

    .shiftcomplete-achievement-name {
      font-weight: 700;
      color: var(--ink);
    }

    .score-display {
      font-family: var(--font-title);
      font-size: clamp(2.5rem, 6vmin, 3.5rem);
      color: var(--signal);
      text-align: center;
      letter-spacing: 0.12em;
      padding: 20px 0;
      text-shadow: 0 0 8px currentColor;
    }
    .score-sub-label {
      font-size: clamp(0.62rem, 1.2vmin, 0.72rem);
      color: var(--muted);
      text-align: center;
      letter-spacing: 0.14em;
      text-transform: uppercase;
      margin-top: -10px;
    }
    .score-highlight {
      color: var(--signal);
      font-size: 1.2em;
      text-shadow: 0 0 6px currentColor;
    }
    .shiftcomplete-full-width, .severed-full-width {
      grid-column: 1 / -1;
    }
    .volume-control {
      margin-top: 10px;
      padding-top: 10px;
      border-top: 1px dashed var(--line);
      display: grid;
      grid-template-columns: auto 1fr auto auto;
      gap: 8px;
      align-items: center;
    }
    .volume-label {
      font-size: 0.7rem;
      text-transform: uppercase;
      letter-spacing: 0.05em;
      color: var(--muted);
    }
    .volume-slider-container {
      position: relative;
      display: flex;
      align-items: center;
    }
    .volume-slider {
      width: 100%;
      height: 4px;
      -webkit-appearance: none;
      appearance: none;
      background: var(--line);
      outline: none;
      border-radius: 2px;
      position: relative;
      z-index: 0;
    }
    .volume-slider::-webkit-slider-thumb {
      -webkit-appearance: none;
      appearance: none;
      width: 14px;
      height: 14px;
      background: var(--accent);
      cursor: pointer;
      border-radius: 50%;
      border: 2px solid var(--bg);
      box-shadow: 0 0 4px rgba(0,0,0,0.3);
    }
    .volume-slider::-moz-range-thumb {
      width: 14px;
      height: 14px;
      background: var(--accent);
      cursor: pointer;
      border-radius: 50%;
      border: 2px solid var(--bg);
      box-shadow: 0 0 4px rgba(0,0,0,0.3);
    }
    .volume-default-marker {
      position: absolute;
      top: 50%;
      transform: translate(-50%, -50%);
      width: 2px;
      height: 12px;
      background: var(--muted);
      opacity: 0.5;
      pointer-events: none;
      z-index: 1;
    }
    .volume-current-marker {
      position: absolute;
      top: 50%;
      transform: translate(-50%, -50%);
      width: 3px;
      height: 20px;
      background: linear-gradient(to bottom, var(--accent) 0%, var(--accent) 100%);
      pointer-events: none;
      z-index: 10;
      transition: left 0.15s ease;
      box-shadow: 0 0 12px var(--accent), 0 0 4px var(--accent), inset 0 0 2px rgba(255,255,255,0.8);
      border-radius: 2px;
    }
    .volume-current-marker::before {
      content: '';
      position: absolute;
      top: -3px;
      left: 50%;
      transform: translateX(-50%);
      width: 0;
      height: 0;
      border-left: 4px solid transparent;
      border-right: 4px solid transparent;
      border-top: 5px solid var(--accent);
      filter: drop-shadow(0 0 4px var(--accent));
    }
    .volume-current-marker::after {
      content: '';
      position: absolute;
      bottom: -3px;
      left: 50%;
      transform: translateX(-50%);
      width: 0;
      height: 0;
      border-left: 4px solid transparent;
      border-right: 4px solid transparent;
      border-bottom: 5px solid var(--accent);
      filter: drop-shadow(0 0 4px var(--accent));
    }
    .volume-value {
      font-family: var(--font-mono);
      font-size: 0.7rem;
      color: var(--ink);
      min-width: 36px;
      text-align: right;
    }
    .btn-volume-reset {
      font-family: var(--font-title);
      font-size: 0.62rem;
      padding: 4px 8px;
      letter-spacing: 0.08em;
      background: transparent;
      border: 1px solid var(--line);
      color: var(--muted);
      cursor: pointer;
      transition: all 0.12s ease;
    }
    .btn-volume-reset:hover {
      background: var(--line);
      color: var(--ink);
    }
    @media (max-width: 720px) {
      .volume-control {
        grid-template-columns: 1fr;
        gap: 6px;
      }
      .volume-label {
        display: none;
      }
    }

    .ctl { display: grid; gap: 4px; text-align: right; }
    .ctl label {
      font-size: 0.62rem;
      text-transform: uppercase;
      letter-spacing: 0.18em;
      color: var(--muted);
    }

    .gate-display {
      font-family: var(--font-title);
      font-size: 0.85rem;
      color: var(--signal);
      background: rgba(0,0,0,0.25);
      border: 1px solid var(--line);
      border-radius: 4px;
      padding: 8px 10px;
      letter-spacing: 0.08em;
      text-transform: uppercase;
      min-width: 140px;
    }

    select, button, input {
      font-family: var(--font-title);
      font-size: 0.85rem;
      color: var(--signal);
      background: rgba(0,0,0,0.25);
      border: 1px solid var(--line);
      border-radius: 4px;
      padding: 8px 10px;
      outline: none;
    }
    select:focus, input:focus {
      box-shadow: 0 0 0 2px rgba(255,255,255,0.06), 0 0 18px var(--glow);
    }

    /* Ensure dropdown options are readable on all browsers and system themes */
    select option {
      background: #0a0a0c;
      color: #ffffff;
      padding: 8px 10px;
      font-family: var(--font-title);
    }
    select option:checked {
      background: var(--signal);
      color: #000000;
      font-weight: bold;
    }
    button { cursor: pointer; transition: all 0.12s; }
    button:hover { background: rgba(255,255,255,0.05); box-shadow: 0 0 14px var(--glow); }
    button:active { background: var(--signal); color: #000; box-shadow: 0 0 18px var(--signal); }
    button:disabled,
    button[disabled] {
      cursor: not-allowed;
      opacity: 0.4;
      color: rgba(255,255,255,0.3);
      border-color: rgba(255,255,255,0.1);
      background: rgba(255,255,255,0.05);
    }
    button.btn-disabled {
      cursor: not-allowed;
      opacity: 0.4;
      color: rgba(255,255,255,0.3);
      border-color: rgba(255,255,255,0.1);
      background: rgba(255,255,255,0.05);
    }

    /* Maximize button in panel headers */
    .btn-maximize {
      position: absolute;
      right: 8px;
      top: 50%;
      transform: translateY(-50%);

      padding: 4px 8px;
      font-size: 0.85em;
      line-height: 1;

      background: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.3);
      border: 1px solid var(--line);
      border-radius: var(--radius);
      color: var(--signal);

      cursor: pointer;
      opacity: 0.6;
      transition: all 0.15s ease;

      font-family: var(--font-title);
      letter-spacing: 0.05em;
    }

    .btn-maximize:hover {
      opacity: 1;
      background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.05);
      border-color: var(--signal);
      box-shadow: 0 0 10px var(--glow);
    }

    .btn-maximize:active {
      background: var(--signal);
      color: #000;
      box-shadow: 0 0 14px var(--signal);
      transform: translateY(-50%) scale(0.95);
    }

    .btn-maximize:focus-visible {
      outline: 2px solid var(--signal);
      outline-offset: 2px;
      opacity: 1;
    }

    /* Ensure panel header has position context and room for button */
    .panel-header {
      position: relative;
      padding-right: 40px;
    }

    /* Mobile adjustments */
    @media (max-width: 700px) {
      .btn-maximize {
        font-size: 0.75em;
        padding: 3px 6px;
        right: 6px;
      }
      .panel-header {
        padding-right: 35px;
      }
    }

    /* Fullscreen button in header (inline version of btn-maximize) */
    .btn-fullscreen {
      padding: 4px 8px;
      font-size: 0.85em;
      line-height: 1;

      background: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.3);
      border: 1px solid var(--line);
      border-radius: var(--radius);
      color: var(--signal);

      cursor: pointer;
      opacity: 0.6;
      transition: all 0.15s ease;

      font-family: var(--font-title);
      letter-spacing: 0.05em;
    }

    .btn-fullscreen:hover {
      opacity: 1;
      background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.05);
      border-color: var(--signal);
      box-shadow: 0 0 10px var(--glow);
    }

    .btn-fullscreen:active {
      background: var(--signal);
      color: #000;
      box-shadow: 0 0 14px var(--signal);
      transform: scale(0.95);
    }

    .btn-fullscreen:focus-visible {
      outline: 2px solid var(--signal);
      outline-offset: 2px;
      opacity: 1;
    }

    /* Keyboard navigation selection highlight */
    .kb-selected {
      outline: 2px solid var(--signal) !important;
      box-shadow: 0 0 20px var(--glow) !important;
      position: relative;
      z-index: 100;
    }
    button.kb-selected,
    select.kb-selected,
    input.kb-selected {
      background: rgba(255,255,255,0.08) !important;
    }
    .panel-header.kb-selected,
    .subsection-header.kb-selected {
      background: rgba(255,255,255,0.05);
    }

    /* Gamepad navigation selection highlight */
    .gp-selected {
      outline: 2px solid var(--signal) !important;
      box-shadow: 0 0 20px var(--glow) !important;
      position: relative;
      z-index: 100;
    }
    button.gp-selected,
    select.gp-selected,
    input.gp-selected {
      background: rgba(255,255,255,0.08) !important;
    }
    .panel-header.gp-selected,
    .subsection-header.gp-selected {
      background: rgba(255,255,255,0.05);
    }

    /* Virtual keyboard */
    .virtual-keyboard {
      position: absolute;
      top: 0;
      right: -320px;
      width: 300px;
      height: 100%;
      background: var(--deep);
      border: 2px solid var(--line);
      border-radius: var(--radius);
      padding: var(--frame-pad);
      display: none;
      overflow: auto;
    }
    .virtual-keyboard.visible {
      display: block;
    }
    .vk-header {
      font-size: 0.8rem;
      color: var(--dim);
      margin-bottom: 8px;
      display: flex;
      justify-content: space-between;
    }
    .vk-display {
      background: rgba(0,0,0,0.3);
      border: 1px solid var(--line);
      padding: 8px;
      margin-bottom: 8px;
      min-height: 32px;
      font-family: var(--mono);
      color: var(--ink);
    }
    .vk-grid {
      display: grid;
      grid-template-columns: repeat(3, 1fr);
      gap: 4px;
    }
    .vk-key {
      padding: 8px 4px;
      background: rgba(255,255,255,0.05);
      border: 1px solid var(--line);
      color: var(--ink);
      text-align: center;
      font-size: 0.75rem;
      cursor: pointer;
    }
    .vk-key.wide {
      grid-column: span 2;
    }
    .vk-key.gp-selected {
      outline: 2px solid var(--signal);
      box-shadow: 0 0 20px var(--glow);
      background: rgba(255,255,255,0.08);
    }

    /* Terminal panel positioning when keyboard visible */
    #terminal.panel {
      position: relative;
    }
    #terminal.has-virtual-keyboard {
      padding-right: 320px;
    }

    button.btn-busy {
      cursor: wait;
      color: var(--stat);
      border-color: rgba(210,169,90,0.45);
      background: rgba(210,169,90,0.08);
      box-shadow: 0 0 12px rgba(210,169,90,0.2);
    }
    
    button.btn-cooldown {
      cursor: not-allowed;
      opacity: 0.55;
      color: var(--muted);
      border-color: rgba(255,255,255,0.10);
      background: rgba(0,0,0,0.20);
      box-shadow: inset 0 0 10px rgba(0,0,0,0.35);
    }
    button.btn-cooldown:hover {
      background: rgba(0,0,0,0.20);
      box-shadow: inset 0 0 10px rgba(0,0,0,0.35);
    }

button.btn-error {
      animation: btnErrorFlash 0.45s ease-out;
      color: #ffe6e6;
      border-color: rgba(225,100,100,0.75);
      background: rgba(225,100,100,0.28);
      box-shadow: 0 0 18px rgba(225,100,100,0.45);
    }
    @keyframes btnErrorFlash {
      0% { transform: scale(1); }
      45% { transform: scale(1.02); }
      100% { transform: scale(1); }
    }
    button.btn-danger {
      color: #ffe6e6;
      border-color: rgba(225,100,100,0.55);
      background: rgba(225,100,100,0.18);
      box-shadow: 0 0 16px rgba(225,100,100,0.25);
    }
    button.btn-danger:hover {
      background: rgba(225,100,100,0.28);
      box-shadow: 0 0 18px rgba(225,100,100,0.35);
    }
    button.btn-danger:active {
      background: var(--alert);
      color: #130606;
      box-shadow: 0 0 20px rgba(225,100,100,0.6);
    }
    button.btn-clearance {
      color: #2b1900;
      border-color: rgba(248, 201, 78, 0.75);
      background: rgba(248, 201, 78, 0.28);
      box-shadow: 0 0 18px rgba(248, 201, 78, 0.45);
      letter-spacing: 0.16em;
      font-weight: 700;
      animation: clearancePulse 1.6s ease-in-out infinite;
    }
    button.btn-clearance:hover {
      background: rgba(248, 201, 78, 0.4);
      box-shadow: 0 0 24px rgba(248, 201, 78, 0.55);
    }
    button.btn-clearance:active {
      background: #f8c94e;
      color: #1d1100;
      box-shadow: 0 0 28px rgba(248, 201, 78, 0.65);
    }
    @keyframes clearancePulse {
      0% { box-shadow: 0 0 10px rgba(248, 201, 78, 0.25); }
      50% { box-shadow: 0 0 26px rgba(248, 201, 78, 0.6); }
      100% { box-shadow: 0 0 10px rgba(248, 201, 78, 0.25); }
    }

    .stats {
      text-align: right;
      font-size: clamp(0.7rem, 1.8vmin, 0.9rem);
      color: var(--muted);
      display: grid;
      gap: 4px;
    }
    .stat-row { display: flex; gap: 10px; justify-content: flex-end; align-items: baseline; flex-wrap: wrap; }
    .stat-label { letter-spacing: 0.14em; text-transform: uppercase; font-size: 0.72rem; }
    .operator-slot { display: inline-flex; align-items: baseline; gap: 8px; }
    .operator-label { cursor: pointer; }
    .operator-slot.editing .operator-label { display: none; }
    .operator-callsign {
      display: inline-block;
      margin-left: 4px;
      padding: 2px 6px;
      border-radius: 4px;
      border: 1px solid var(--line);
      color: var(--signal);
      background: rgba(0,0,0,0.35);
      box-shadow: 0 0 12px var(--glow);
      letter-spacing: 0.16em;
      font-weight: 700;
      text-shadow: 0 0 12px var(--glow);
    }
    .operator-input {
      display: none;
      min-width: 130px;
      font-size: 0.7rem;
      letter-spacing: 0.12em;
      text-transform: uppercase;
      background: rgba(0,0,0,0.35);
      border: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.15);
      color: var(--muted);
      padding: 4px 6px;
      border-radius: 6px;
      scroll-margin-bottom: 20px;
      outline: none;
    }
    .operator-slot.editing .operator-input { display: inline-block; }
    .stat-value {
      color: var(--stat);
      font-weight: bold;
      font-size: clamp(0.95rem, 2.2vmin, 1.2rem);
      font-family: var(--font-title);
      letter-spacing: 0.06em;
    }
    .stat-divider {
      color: var(--muted);
      letter-spacing: 0.18em;
    }

    .label {
      font-size: 0.72rem;
      text-transform: uppercase;
      letter-spacing: 0.15em;
      color: var(--muted);
      margin-bottom: 8px;
    }

    /* Collapsible panel headers */
    .panel-header,
    .subsection-header {
      cursor: pointer;
      user-select: none;
      display: flex;
      align-items: center;
      gap: 8px;
      transition: background 0.15s ease;
    }

    .panel-header:hover,
    .subsection-header:hover {
      background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.03);
      border-radius: 3px;
    }

    .panel-header:active,
    .subsection-header:active {
      background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.06);
    }

    /* Chevron icons */
    .panel-chevron,
    .subsection-chevron {
      display: inline-block;
      font-size: 0.7em;
      transition: transform 0.2s ease;
      color: var(--signal);
      text-shadow: 0 0 8px var(--glow);
    }

    /* Rotate chevron when collapsed */
    .panel.collapsed .panel-chevron,
    .queue-section.collapsed .subsection-chevron,
    .sys-block.collapsed .subsection-chevron,
    .logbox.collapsed .subsection-chevron {
      transform: rotate(-90deg);
    }

    /* Content wrappers - ensure they work with grid layout */
    .panel-content {
      display: contents; /* Makes wrapper transparent to grid layout */
    }

    .subsection-content {
      min-height: 0; /* Critical for grid overflow */
      display: contents; /* Makes wrapper transparent to grid layout */
    }

    #systems .sys-block:not(.collapsed) .subsection-header {
      margin-bottom: 4px;
    }

    /* Hide content when collapsed */
    .panel.collapsed .panel-content,
    .queue-section.collapsed .subsection-content,
    .sys-block.collapsed .subsection-content,
    .logbox.collapsed .subsection-content {
      display: none;
    }

    /* Visual feedback for collapsed state */
    .panel.collapsed,
    .queue-section.collapsed,
    .sys-block.collapsed,
    .logbox.collapsed {
      opacity: 0.7;
      transition: opacity 0.2s ease;
    }

    .panel.collapsed:hover,
    .queue-section.collapsed:hover,
    .sys-block.collapsed:hover,
    .logbox.collapsed:hover {
      opacity: 0.9;
    }

    /* Collapse grid structure when queue-section is collapsed */
    .queue-section.collapsed {
      grid-template-rows: auto 0;
      gap: 0;
      min-height: 0;
      height: fit-content;
      padding-bottom: 8px;
    }
    .sys-block.collapsed {
      padding-top: 6px;
      padding-bottom: 6px;
    }

    /* Grid adjustments for collapsed panels */
    #traffic.collapsed,
    #systems.collapsed,
    #terminal.collapsed {
      grid-template-rows: auto;
    }

    .interface {
      display: grid;
      grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr;
      grid-template-rows: minmax(0, 1fr) var(--terminal-h);
      grid-template-areas:
        "traffic systems"
        "terminal terminal";
      gap: var(--interface-gap);
      min-height: 0;
      overflow: hidden;
    }

    .panel {
      border: 1px solid var(--line);
      background: rgba(0,0,0,0.25);
      border-radius: var(--radius);
      box-shadow: inset 0 0 12px rgba(0,0,0,0.45);
      padding: 10px;
      min-height: 0;
      position: relative;
      isolation: isolate; /* helps prevent hit-testing weirdness */
    }
    .panel::before {
      content: "";
      position: absolute;
      inset: 0;
      z-index: 0;
      background:
        linear-gradient(transparent 70%, rgba(255,255,255,0.015) 70%),
        radial-gradient(circle at 20% 0%, var(--grid) 0%, transparent 55%);
      pointer-events: none;
      opacity: 0.8;
    }
    .panel > * { position: relative; z-index: 1; }

    #traffic { grid-area: traffic; display: grid; grid-template-rows: auto minmax(0,1fr); gap: 10px; }
    #systems { grid-area: systems; display: grid; grid-template-rows: auto minmax(0,1fr); gap: 10px; }
    #terminal { grid-area: terminal; display: grid; grid-template-rows: auto minmax(0,1fr) auto; gap: 8px; }

    .queue { display: grid; grid-template-columns: 1fr; grid-template-rows: minmax(0, 1fr) minmax(0, 1fr); gap: 10px; min-height: 0; }

    .queue-section {
      border: 1px dashed var(--line);
      border-radius: 4px;
      padding: 8px;
      background: rgba(0,0,0,0.18);
      min-height: 0;
      display: grid;
      grid-template-rows: auto minmax(0, 1fr);
      gap: 6px;
    }

    .queue-head { display: flex; justify-content: space-between; align-items: baseline; gap: 10px; }

    .queue-title {
      font-family: var(--font-title);
      letter-spacing: 0.12em;
      text-transform: uppercase;
      color: var(--signal);
      font-size: 0.85rem;
    }
    .queue-meta {
      font-size: 0.72rem;
      color: var(--muted);
      letter-spacing: 0.12em;
      text-transform: uppercase;
      white-space: nowrap;
    }

    .scroll { overflow: auto; -webkit-overflow-scrolling: touch; min-height: 0; }

    table { width: 100%; border-collapse: collapse; font-size: 0.85rem; table-layout: fixed; }
    th, td {
      padding: 6px 6px;
      border-bottom: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.04);
      vertical-align: top;
      overflow: hidden;
      text-overflow: ellipsis;
    }
    th {
      color: var(--muted);
      font-weight: 700;
      font-family: var(--font-title);
      letter-spacing: 0.12em;
      text-transform: uppercase;
      font-size: 0.68rem;
      white-space: nowrap;
    }

    th:last-child, td:last-child { width: 210px; }
    th:nth-child(2), td:nth-child(2) { width: 74px; }
    th:nth-child(1), td:nth-child(1) { width: 118px; }

    td.code {
      font-family: var(--font-title);
      color: var(--ink);
      letter-spacing: 0.08em;
      white-space: nowrap;
    }

    .pill {
      display: inline-flex;
      align-items: center;
      gap: 6px;
      border: 1px solid var(--line);
      padding: 2px 8px;
      border-radius: 999px;
      font-size: 0.72rem;
      letter-spacing: 0.12em;
      text-transform: uppercase;
      color: var(--muted);
      background: rgba(0,0,0,0.15);
      white-space: nowrap;
    }
    .pill.ok { color: var(--signal); }
    .pill.warn { color: var(--stat); border-color: rgba(210,169,90,0.25); text-shadow: 0 0 6px rgba(0,0,0,0.7), 0 0 10px currentColor; }
    .pill.bad { color: var(--alert); border-color: rgba(225,100,100,0.25); text-shadow: 0 0 6px rgba(0,0,0,0.7), 0 0 10px currentColor; }

    .gate-head-pills {
      display: flex;
      gap: 6px;
      align-items: center;
      justify-content: flex-end;
      flex-wrap: wrap;
    }
    .gate-alert-timer {
      letter-spacing: 0.18em;
      text-transform: uppercase;
    }
    .gate-alert-pulse {
      color: var(--alert);
      font-weight: 700;
      text-shadow: 0 0 8px rgba(225, 100, 100, 0.45);
      animation: gateAlertPulse 1.1s ease-in-out infinite;
    }
    @keyframes gateAlertPulse {
      0%, 100% {
        color: var(--alert);
        text-shadow: 0 0 6px rgba(225, 100, 100, 0.35);
      }
      50% {
        color: #f8d2d2;
        text-shadow: 0 0 14px rgba(225, 100, 100, 0.65);
      }
    }
    .beacon-pill {
      letter-spacing: 0.12em;
    }
    .beacon-pill.offline {
      background: rgba(225,100,100,0.08);
      border-color: rgba(225,100,100,0.35);
      color: var(--alert);
      box-shadow: 0 0 10px rgba(225,100,100,0.2);
      animation: beaconPulse 1.1s ease-in-out infinite;
    }
    .beacon-pill.fault {
      background: rgba(210,169,90,0.08);
      border-color: rgba(210,169,90,0.35);
      color: var(--stat);
      box-shadow: 0 0 10px rgba(210,169,90,0.2);
      animation: beaconPulse 1.4s ease-in-out infinite;
    }
    @keyframes beaconPulse {
      0%, 100% { box-shadow: 0 0 6px rgba(255,255,255,0.08); }
      50% { box-shadow: 0 0 14px rgba(255,255,255,0.25); }
    }

    /* Deadline urgency row highlighting */
    tr.urgency-critical {
      background-color: rgba(225, 100, 100, 0.08);
      animation: pulse-urgent 2s ease-in-out infinite;
    }

    tr.urgency-high {
      background-color: rgba(210, 169, 90, 0.06);
    }

    tr.urgency-medium {
      background-color: rgba(210, 169, 90, 0.03);
    }

    @keyframes pulse-urgent {
      0%, 100% { background-color: rgba(225, 100, 100, 0.08); }
      50% { background-color: rgba(225, 100, 100, 0.15); }
    }

    /* Ship hazard highlighting */
    tr.ship-hazard-danger {
      background-color: rgba(225, 100, 100, 0.12);
      border-left: 3px solid rgba(225, 100, 100, 0.6);
    }

    tr.ship-unknown-warning {
      background-color: rgba(210, 169, 90, 0.08);
      border-left: 3px solid rgba(210, 169, 90, 0.5);
    }

    /* Dock congestion pulse animation */
    .status-row.congested-pulse {
      animation: congestedPulse 1.8s ease-in-out infinite;
    }
    @keyframes congestedPulse {
      0%, 100% {
        background-color: rgba(210, 169, 90, 0.08);
        box-shadow: 0 0 6px rgba(210, 169, 90, 0.2);
      }
      50% {
        background-color: rgba(210, 169, 90, 0.16);
        box-shadow: 0 0 12px rgba(210, 169, 90, 0.35);
      }
    }

    /* Critical exposure pulse animation for docked slots */
    .status-row.exposure-critical {
      animation: exposureCriticalPulse 1s ease-in-out infinite;
    }
    @keyframes exposureCriticalPulse {
      0%, 100% {
        background-color: rgba(225, 100, 100, 0.12);
        box-shadow: 0 0 8px rgba(225, 100, 100, 0.3);
      }
      50% {
        background-color: rgba(225, 100, 100, 0.22);
        box-shadow: 0 0 16px rgba(225, 100, 100, 0.5);
      }
    }

    /* Propagated alert pulses for collapsed panels/subsections */
    .panel-header.alert-propagated-ack,
    .subsection-header.alert-propagated-ack {
      animation: headerAckPulse 0.9s ease-in-out infinite;
    }
    @keyframes headerAckPulse {
      0%, 100% {
        background-color: rgba(210, 169, 90, 0.12);
        box-shadow: 0 0 8px rgba(210, 169, 90, 0.35);
      }
      50% {
        background-color: rgba(210, 169, 90, 0.22);
        box-shadow: 0 0 16px rgba(210, 169, 90, 0.6);
      }
    }

    .panel-header.alert-propagated-exposure,
    .subsection-header.alert-propagated-exposure {
      animation: headerExposurePulse 1s ease-in-out infinite;
    }
    @keyframes headerExposurePulse {
      0%, 100% {
        background-color: rgba(225, 100, 100, 0.15);
        box-shadow: 0 0 10px rgba(225, 100, 100, 0.4);
      }
      50% {
        background-color: rgba(225, 100, 100, 0.28);
        box-shadow: 0 0 18px rgba(225, 100, 100, 0.65);
      }
    }

    .panel-header.alert-propagated-gate-critical,
    .subsection-header.alert-propagated-gate-critical {
      animation: headerGateCriticalPulse 1s ease-in-out infinite;
    }
    @keyframes headerGateCriticalPulse {
      0%, 100% {
        background-color: rgba(225, 100, 100, 0.14);
        box-shadow: 0 0 10px rgba(225, 100, 100, 0.4);
      }
      50% {
        background-color: rgba(225, 100, 100, 0.26);
        box-shadow: 0 0 18px rgba(225, 100, 100, 0.65);
      }
    }

    .panel-header.alert-propagated-congested,
    .subsection-header.alert-propagated-congested {
      animation: headerCongestedPulse 1.8s ease-in-out infinite;
    }
    @keyframes headerCongestedPulse {
      0%, 100% {
        background-color: rgba(255, 184, 77, 0.12);
        box-shadow: 0 0 8px rgba(255, 184, 77, 0.35);
      }
      50% {
        background-color: rgba(255, 184, 77, 0.22);
        box-shadow: 0 0 16px rgba(255, 184, 77, 0.55);
      }
    }

    .panel-header.alert-propagated-relay-ping,
    .subsection-header.alert-propagated-relay-ping {
      animation: headerRelayPingPulse 0.9s ease-out 1;
    }
    @keyframes headerRelayPingPulse {
      0% { background-color: rgba(77, 255, 154, 0.3); box-shadow: 0 0 16px rgba(77, 255, 154, 0.5); }
      100% { background-color: rgba(77, 255, 154, 0.05); box-shadow: 0 0 4px rgba(77, 255, 154, 0.15); }
    }

    .panel-header.alert-propagated-awaiting-action,
    .subsection-header.alert-propagated-awaiting-action {
      animation: headerAwaitingActionPulse 2s ease-in-out infinite;
    }
    @keyframes headerAwaitingActionPulse {
      0%, 100% {
        background-color: rgba(255, 220, 100, 0.08);
        box-shadow: 0 0 6px rgba(255, 220, 100, 0.25);
      }
      50% {
        background-color: rgba(255, 220, 100, 0.15);
        box-shadow: 0 0 12px rgba(255, 220, 100, 0.4);
      }
    }

    /* Deadline countdown styling */
    .status-meta {
      font-size: 0.7rem;
      margin-top: 4px;
      opacity: 0.9;
    }

    /* Dynamic deadline severity colors based on time remaining */
    .status-meta.deadline-dim {
      color: var(--dim);
      opacity: 0.7;
    }

    .status-meta.deadline-warn {
      color: var(--stat);
      font-weight: 600;
      text-shadow: 0 0 6px rgba(0,0,0,0.7), 0 0 10px currentColor;
    }

    .status-meta.deadline-bad {
      color: var(--alert);
      font-weight: 700;
      text-shadow: 0 0 6px rgba(0,0,0,0.7), 0 0 10px currentColor;
    }

    /* Legacy static classes (kept for compatibility) */
    .status-meta.deadline-critical {
      color: var(--alert);
      font-weight: 700;
      text-shadow: 0 0 6px rgba(0,0,0,0.7), 0 0 10px currentColor;
    }

    .status-meta.deadline-urgent {
      color: var(--stat);
    }

    .status-meta.deadline-standard {
      color: var(--dim);
    }

    .status-meta.deadline-relaxed {
      color: var(--dim);
      opacity: 0.7;
    }

    /* Critical deadline pulse animation for last 10 seconds */
    tr.ship-deadline-critical-pulse {
      animation: shipDeadlineCriticalPulse 1.0s ease-in-out infinite;
    }

    @keyframes shipDeadlineCriticalPulse {
      0%, 100% {
        background-color: rgba(225, 100, 100, 0.12);
        box-shadow: 0 0 4px rgba(225, 100, 100, 0.2);
      }
      50% {
        background-color: rgba(225, 100, 100, 0.20);
        box-shadow: 0 0 8px rgba(225, 100, 100, 0.3);
      }
    }

    .row-actions { display: flex; gap: 6px; flex-wrap: nowrap; justify-content: flex-end; align-items: center; }
    td.action-cell { overflow: visible; }
    .btn-mini {
      padding: 4px 8px;
      font-size: 0.72rem;
      letter-spacing: 0.12em;
      text-transform: uppercase;
      border-radius: 4px;
      white-space: nowrap;
      line-height: 1.2;
      display: inline-flex;
      align-items: center;
      justify-content: center;
      min-width: 44px;
    }
    .btn-mini.attn {
      color: #140f06;
      background: rgba(210,169,90,0.9);
      border-color: rgba(210,169,90,0.8);
      box-shadow: 0 0 16px rgba(210,169,90,0.5);
      animation: ackPulse 0.9s ease-in-out infinite;
    }
    .btn-mini.deny { color: var(--alert); border-color: rgba(225,100,100,0.35); }
    .btn-mini.hold { color: var(--stat); border-color: rgba(210,169,90,0.35); }
    .btn-mini.approve { color: var(--signal); }
    .btn-mini:active { background: rgba(255,255,255,0.06); color: var(--ink); }

    /* Disabled buttons for finalized decisions */
    .btn-mini.disabled {
      opacity: 0.35;
      color: #666;
      border-color: rgba(100,100,100,0.25);
      cursor: not-allowed;
    }
    .btn-mini.disabled:hover {
      opacity: 0.35;
      color: #666;
    }
    .btn-mini.disabled:active {
      background: transparent;
      color: #666;
    }

    /* Error animation for attempting to change finalized decisions */
    @keyframes decisionLockedShake {
      0%, 100% { transform: translateX(0); }
      15% { transform: translateX(-6px); }
      30% { transform: translateX(6px); }
      45% { transform: translateX(-6px); }
      60% { transform: translateX(6px); }
      75% { transform: translateX(-3px); }
    }
    tr.decision-locked-error {
      animation: decisionLockedShake 0.6s ease-in-out;
      background: rgba(225,100,100,0.15);
    }

    /* Inline ship detail panels (DTL / DETAIL) */
    .detail-row td { padding: 0 6px 8px; }
    .dock-inline-detail { margin: -2px 0 10px 0; padding-left: 10px; }

    .inline-detail {
      border: 1px solid var(--line);
      border-radius: 8px;
      background: rgba(0,0,0,0.18);
      padding: 10px;
      box-shadow: 0 0 18px rgba(0,0,0,0.35);
    }
    .inline-detail.inline-detail-compact { padding: 8px; }

    /* Crew deceased styling */
    .crew-deceased {
      color: var(--alert);
      font-weight: bold;
    }

    .cargo-illegal {
      color: var(--alert);
      font-weight: bold;
    }

    .inline-detail-head {
      display: flex;
      align-items: flex-start;
      justify-content: space-between;
      gap: 12px;
      margin-bottom: 8px;
    }
    .inline-detail-title {
      font-family: var(--font-title);
      letter-spacing: 0.18em;
      text-transform: uppercase;
      font-size: 0.72rem;
      color: var(--signal);
      line-height: 1.2;
    }
    .inline-detail-sub {
      margin-top: 4px;
      font-size: 0.72rem;
      opacity: 0.85;
    }
    .inline-detail .kv { grid-template-columns: 120px 1fr; }
    .inline-detail .v { white-space: normal; overflow-wrap: anywhere; }

    .btn-mini.detail-open {
      color: var(--ink);
      border-color: rgba(255,255,255,0.25);
      box-shadow: 0 0 14px var(--glow);
    }

    @keyframes ackPulse {
      0%, 100% { box-shadow: 0 0 10px rgba(210,169,90,0.3); }
      50% { box-shadow: 0 0 18px rgba(210,169,90,0.7); }
    }
    .btn-mini.broadcast-pulse {
      animation: broadcastPulse 0.6s ease-in-out infinite;
    }
    @keyframes broadcastPulse {
      0%, 100% {
        box-shadow: 0 0 14px rgba(225,100,100,0.5);
        transform: scale(1);
      }
      50% {
        box-shadow: 0 0 24px rgba(225,100,100,0.9);
        transform: scale(1.05);
      }
    }

    .sys-grid { display: grid; grid-template-columns: 1fr; gap: 10px; min-height: 0; overflow: auto; padding-right: 4px; }
    .sys-block {
      border: 1px dashed var(--line);
      border-radius: 4px;
      padding: 8px;
      background: rgba(0,0,0,0.18);
    }
    .overall-summary {
      margin-top: 6px;
      font-size: 0.68rem;
      color: var(--muted);
      letter-spacing: 0.12em;
      text-transform: uppercase;
    }
    .stat-summary {
      margin-top: 0;
    }

    .kv {
      display: grid;
      grid-template-columns: 140px 1fr;
      gap: 6px 10px;
      align-items: baseline;
      font-size: 0.85rem;
    }
    .kv .k {
      color: var(--muted);
      letter-spacing: 0.12em;
      text-transform: uppercase;
      font-size: 0.70rem;
      font-family: var(--font-title);
    }
    .kv .v {
      font-family: var(--font-title);
      letter-spacing: 0.08em;
      color: var(--ink);
    }
    .kv .v.good {
      color: var(--good);
    }
    .kv .v.warn {
      color: var(--stat);
      text-shadow: 0 0 6px rgba(0,0,0,0.7), 0 0 10px currentColor;
    }
    .kv .v.bad {
      color: var(--alert);
      text-shadow: 0 0 6px rgba(0,0,0,0.7), 0 0 10px currentColor;
    }

    .sys-actions { display: flex; gap: 8px; flex-wrap: wrap; }
    .sys-actions button {
      padding: 8px 10px;
      font-size: 0.75rem;
      letter-spacing: 0.12em;
      text-transform: uppercase;
      border-radius: 4px;
    }
    .status-list {
      display: grid;
      gap: 6px;
      font-size: 0.82rem;
    }
    .status-row {
      display: grid;
      grid-template-columns: 1.2fr auto;
      gap: 8px;
      align-items: baseline;
    }
    .status-row.relay-ping {
      position: relative;
    }
    .status-row.relay-ping::after {
      content: "";
      position: absolute;
      inset: -4px -6px;
      border-radius: 6px;
      border: 1px solid var(--signal);
      box-shadow: 0 0 14px var(--signal);
      opacity: 0.75;
      pointer-events: none;
      transform-origin: center;
      animation: relayPingPulse 0.9s ease-out 1;
    }
    .status-row.relay-ping .status-name {
      color: var(--signal);
      text-shadow: 0 0 10px var(--signal);
    }
    @keyframes relayPingPulse {
      0% { opacity: 0.8; transform: scale(0.98); }
      100% { opacity: 0; transform: scale(1.03); }
    }
    /* Gate Network ping animation */
    .status-row.gate-ping {
      position: relative;
    }
    .status-row.gate-ping::after {
      content: "";
      position: absolute;
      inset: -4px -6px;
      border-radius: 6px;
      border: 1px solid var(--stat);
      box-shadow: 0 0 14px var(--stat);
      opacity: 0.8;
      pointer-events: none;
      transform-origin: center;
      animation: gatePingPulse 2s ease-in-out infinite;
    }
    .status-row.gate-ping .status-name {
      color: var(--stat);
      text-shadow: 0 0 10px var(--stat);
    }
    @keyframes gatePingPulse {
      0%, 100% {
        opacity: 0.8;
        transform: scale(1);
        box-shadow: 0 0 14px var(--stat);
      }
      50% {
        opacity: 0.4;
        transform: scale(1.02);
        box-shadow: 0 0 20px var(--stat);
      }
    }
    /* Gate Network panel header pulse when collapsed with pending pings */
    #gate-network-panel.collapsed .subsection-header.pending-ping {
      animation: headerPingPulse 2s ease-in-out infinite;
    }
    @keyframes headerPingPulse {
      0%, 100% {
        box-shadow: 0 0 8px var(--stat);
      }
      50% {
        box-shadow: 0 0 16px var(--stat);
      }
    }
    /* Gate Network Filter Bar */
    .gate-filter-bar {
      display: flex;
      align-items: center;
      gap: 8px;
      padding: 6px 12px;
      margin-bottom: 8px;
      background: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.3);
      border-radius: 4px;
      border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.1);
    }
    .gate-filter-bar label {
      color: var(--dim);
      font-size: 0.9em;
      white-space: nowrap;
    }
    .gate-filter-input {
      flex: 1;
      background: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.4);
      border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.15);
      border-radius: 3px;
      color: var(--text);
      padding: 4px 8px;
      font-family: 'IBM Plex Mono', monospace;
      font-size: 0.9em;
    }
    .gate-filter-input:focus {
      outline: none;
      border-color: var(--stat);
      box-shadow: 0 0 8px rgba(210, 169, 90, 0.3);
    }
    /* Gate Network Pagination Controls */
    .gate-pagination {
      display: flex;
      justify-content: space-between;
      align-items: center;
      padding: 8px 12px;
      margin-top: 8px;
      background: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.2);
      border-radius: 4px;
      border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08);
    }
    .gate-page-info {
      color: var(--dim);
      font-size: 0.85em;
      font-family: 'IBM Plex Mono', monospace;
    }
    .gate-page-controls {
      display: flex;
      gap: 6px;
    }
    /* Co-op Gate Network Styles */
    .coop-gate-row {
      background: rgba(80, 180, 120, 0.05);
      border-left: 3px solid var(--signal);
    }
    .coop-session-info {
      font-size: 0.85em;
      color: var(--dim);
      font-family: 'IBM Plex Mono', monospace;
      letter-spacing: 0.1em;
      padding: 2px 8px;
      background: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.3);
      border-radius: 3px;
    }
    .coop-gate-details {
      background: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.2);
      padding: 8px 12px;
      margin: -4px 0 8px 0;
      border-left: 3px solid rgba(80, 180, 120, 0.3);
      border-bottom: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.05);
    }
    .coop-detail-row {
      display: flex;
      justify-content: space-between;
      align-items: center;
      padding: 3px 0;
      font-size: 0.85em;
    }
    .coop-detail-label {
      color: var(--dim);
      font-family: 'IBM Plex Mono', monospace;
      letter-spacing: 0.08em;
    }
    .coop-detail-value {
      color: var(--text);
      font-family: 'IBM Plex Mono', monospace;
      letter-spacing: 0.05em;
    }
    /* Blinking indicator animation */
    .hb-indicator.blink {
      animation: indicatorBlink 1s ease-in-out infinite;
    }
    @keyframes indicatorBlink {
      0%, 100% { opacity: 1; }
      50% { opacity: 0.3; }
    }
    .hb-indicator.ok {
      background: var(--signal);
      box-shadow: 0 0 10px var(--glow);
    }
    .status-name {
      font-family: var(--font-title);
      letter-spacing: 0.08em;
      color: var(--ink);
    }
    .status-meta {
      color: var(--muted);
      letter-spacing: 0.12em;
      text-transform: uppercase;
      font-size: 0.68rem;
      white-space: nowrap;
      text-align: right;
    }
    .relay-row .status-name {
      display: flex;
      align-items: center;
      gap: 8px;
      flex-wrap: wrap;
    }
    .relay-hb {
      display: inline-flex;
      align-items: center;
      gap: 6px;
      font-size: 0.62rem;
      letter-spacing: 0.12em;
      text-transform: uppercase;
      color: var(--muted);
    }
    .hb-indicator {
      position: relative;
      width: 8px;
      height: 6px;
      border-radius: 2px;
      background: var(--signal);
      box-shadow: 0 0 10px var(--glow);
    }
    .hb-indicator.hb-warn {
      background: var(--stat);
      box-shadow: 0 0 10px rgba(210, 169, 90, 0.35);
    }
    .hb-indicator.hb-bad {
      background: var(--alert);
      box-shadow: 0 0 12px rgba(225, 100, 100, 0.45);
    }
    /* Health shift blink animations */
    .hb-indicator.health-blink-positive {
      animation: healthBlinkPositive 0.4s ease-in-out;
      animation-iteration-count: var(--blink-count, 2);
    }
    .hb-indicator.health-blink-warn {
      animation: healthBlinkWarn 0.4s ease-in-out;
      animation-iteration-count: var(--blink-count, 2);
    }
    .hb-indicator.health-blink-positive::after,
    .hb-indicator.health-blink-warn::after {
      content: "";
      position: absolute;
      inset: -5px;
      border-radius: 5px;
      opacity: 0;
      pointer-events: none;
    }
    .hb-indicator.health-blink-positive::after {
      border: 1px solid var(--signal);
      box-shadow: 0 0 16px rgba(77, 255, 154, 0.45);
      animation: healthBlinkHaloPositive 0.4s ease-in-out;
      animation-iteration-count: var(--blink-count, 2);
    }
    .hb-indicator.health-blink-warn::after {
      border: 1px solid var(--stat);
      box-shadow: 0 0 16px rgba(210, 169, 90, 0.45);
      animation: healthBlinkHaloWarn 0.4s ease-in-out;
      animation-iteration-count: var(--blink-count, 2);
    }
    @keyframes healthBlinkPositive {
      0%, 100% {
        background: var(--signal);
        box-shadow: 0 0 10px var(--glow);
        opacity: 1;
        transform: scale(1);
      }
      50% {
        background: var(--signal);
        box-shadow: 0 0 24px var(--signal);
        opacity: 0.35;
        transform: scale(1.7);
      }
    }
    @keyframes healthBlinkWarn {
      0%, 100% {
        background: var(--stat);
        box-shadow: 0 0 10px rgba(210, 169, 90, 0.35);
        opacity: 1;
        transform: scale(1);
      }
      50% {
        background: var(--stat);
        box-shadow: 0 0 24px var(--stat);
        opacity: 0.35;
        transform: scale(1.7);
      }
    }
    @keyframes healthBlinkHaloPositive {
      0%, 100% { opacity: 0; transform: scale(1); }
      50% { opacity: 1; transform: scale(1.5); }
    }
    @keyframes healthBlinkHaloWarn {
      0%, 100% { opacity: 0; transform: scale(1); }
      50% { opacity: 1; transform: scale(1.5); }
    }
    }
    /* Connection Indicator */
    .connection-indicator {
      display: flex;
      align-items: center;
      gap: 8px;
      font-family: var(--font-title);
      letter-spacing: 0.08em;
    }
    .connection-light {
      display: inline-block;
      width: 8px;
      height: 6px;
      border-radius: 2px;
      background: var(--muted);
      box-shadow: 0 0 8px rgba(128, 128, 128, 0.3);
      transition: background 0.3s ease, box-shadow 0.3s ease;
    }
    .connection-light.online {
      background: var(--signal);
      box-shadow: 0 0 10px var(--glow);
    }
    .connection-light.offline {
      background: var(--muted);
      box-shadow: 0 0 6px rgba(128, 128, 128, 0.2);
    }
    .connection-light.flash-yellow {
      animation: flashYellow 0.6s ease-out;
    }
    .connection-light.flash-red {
      animation: flashRed 0.6s ease-out;
    }
    @keyframes flashYellow {
      0%, 100% {
        background: var(--signal);
        box-shadow: 0 0 10px var(--glow);
      }
      50% {
        background: var(--stat);
        box-shadow: 0 0 16px rgba(210, 169, 90, 0.6);
      }
    }
    @keyframes flashRed {
      0%, 100% {
        background: var(--signal);
        box-shadow: 0 0 10px var(--glow);
      }
      50% {
        background: var(--alert);
        box-shadow: 0 0 16px rgba(225, 100, 100, 0.6);
      }
    }
    tr.ship-flagged-pulse {
      animation: shipFlaggedPulse 0.8s ease-out;
    }
    @keyframes shipFlaggedPulse {
      0%, 100% {
        background: transparent;
      }
      50% {
        background: rgba(210, 169, 90, 0.2);
        box-shadow: 0 0 8px rgba(210, 169, 90, 0.4);
      }
    }
    tr.ship-scan-required-pulse {
      animation: shipScanRequiredPulse 0.8s ease-out;
    }
    @keyframes shipScanRequiredPulse {
      0%, 100% {
        background: transparent;
      }
      50% {
        background: rgba(225, 100, 100, 0.25);
        box-shadow: 0 0 10px rgba(225, 100, 100, 0.5);
      }
    }
    tr.ship-hazard-detected-pulse {
      animation: shipHazardDetectedPulse 1.6s ease-out;
    }
    @keyframes shipHazardDetectedPulse {
      0%, 100% {
        background: transparent;
      }
      15% {
        background: rgba(220, 50, 50, 0.35);
        box-shadow: 0 0 12px rgba(220, 50, 50, 0.6);
      }
      30%, 45% {
        background: transparent;
      }
      60% {
        background: rgba(220, 50, 50, 0.35);
        box-shadow: 0 0 12px rgba(220, 50, 50, 0.6);
      }
      75% {
        background: transparent;
      }
    }
    .panel-header.hazard-pulse,
    .subsection-header.hazard-pulse {
      animation: headerHazardPulse 1.6s ease-out;
    }
    @keyframes headerHazardPulse {
      0%, 100% {
        background: transparent;
      }
      15% {
        background: rgba(220, 50, 50, 0.25);
        box-shadow: inset 0 0 8px rgba(220, 50, 50, 0.4);
      }
      30%, 45% {
        background: transparent;
      }
      60% {
        background: rgba(220, 50, 50, 0.25);
        box-shadow: inset 0 0 8px rgba(220, 50, 50, 0.4);
      }
      75% {
        background: transparent;
      }
    }
    /* Signal Masked animation - Cyan/Blue flickering fade */
    tr.ship-signal-masked-pulse {
      animation: shipSignalMaskedPulse 1.2s ease-in-out;
    }
    @keyframes shipSignalMaskedPulse {
      0%, 100% {
        background: transparent;
      }
      20% {
        background: rgba(79, 179, 255, 0.22);
        box-shadow: 0 0 14px rgba(79, 179, 255, 0.4);
      }
      40% {
        background: rgba(79, 179, 255, 0.08);
        box-shadow: 0 0 4px rgba(79, 179, 255, 0.2);
      }
      60% {
        background: rgba(79, 179, 255, 0.18);
        box-shadow: 0 0 10px rgba(79, 179, 255, 0.35);
      }
      80% {
        background: rgba(79, 179, 255, 0.06);
        box-shadow: 0 0 3px rgba(79, 179, 255, 0.15);
      }
    }
    /* QRY Failed animation - Purple downward fade */
    tr.ship-qry-failed-pulse {
      animation: shipQryFailedPulse 1.0s ease-out;
    }
    @keyframes shipQryFailedPulse {
      0% {
        background: rgba(181, 107, 255, 0.28);
        box-shadow: 0 0 16px rgba(181, 107, 255, 0.5);
      }
      30% {
        background: rgba(181, 107, 255, 0.18);
        box-shadow: 0 0 10px rgba(181, 107, 255, 0.35);
      }
      60% {
        background: rgba(181, 107, 255, 0.08);
        box-shadow: 0 0 4px rgba(181, 107, 255, 0.2);
      }
      100% {
        background: transparent;
        box-shadow: none;
      }
    }
    tr.ship-qry-success-pulse {
      animation: shipQrySuccessPulse 1.0s ease-out;
    }
    @keyframes shipQrySuccessPulse {
      0% {
        background: rgba(0, 255, 128, 0.28);
        box-shadow: 0 0 16px rgba(0, 255, 128, 0.5);
      }
      30% {
        background: rgba(0, 255, 128, 0.18);
        box-shadow: 0 0 10px rgba(0, 255, 128, 0.35);
      }
      60% {
        background: rgba(0, 255, 128, 0.08);
        box-shadow: 0 0 4px rgba(0, 255, 128, 0.2);
      }
      100% {
        background: transparent;
        box-shadow: none;
      }
    }
    .status-right {
      display: inline-flex;
      gap: 6px;
      align-items: center;
      justify-content: flex-end;
      flex-wrap: wrap;
    }
    .label-mini {
      margin-top: 6px;
      color: var(--muted);
      letter-spacing: 0.14em;
      text-transform: uppercase;
      font-size: 0.62rem;
    }

    .resource-list { display: grid; gap: 10px; }
    .resource-row { display: grid; gap: 6px; }
    .resource-head { display: flex; justify-content: space-between; align-items: center; gap: 8px; }
    .resource-title {
      font-family: var(--font-title);
      letter-spacing: 0.12em;
      text-transform: uppercase;
      color: var(--signal);
      font-size: 0.74rem;
    }
    .resource-meta {
      font-size: 0.62rem;
      text-transform: uppercase;
      letter-spacing: 0.14em;
      color: var(--muted);
      white-space: nowrap;
    }
    .resource-bar {
      height: 10px;
      border-radius: 999px;
      border: 1px solid var(--line);
      background: rgba(0,0,0,0.35);
      overflow: hidden;
      position: relative;
      box-shadow: inset 0 0 8px rgba(0,0,0,0.45);
    }
    .resource-fill {
      height: 100%;
      width: 0%;
      background: linear-gradient(90deg, var(--signal), rgba(77, 255, 154, 0.25));
      box-shadow: 0 0 10px rgba(77, 255, 154, 0.4);
      transition: width 0.2s ease;
    }
    .resource-fill.warn {
      background: linear-gradient(90deg, #d2a95a, rgba(210, 169, 90, 0.2));
      box-shadow: 0 0 12px rgba(210, 169, 90, 0.45);
    }
    .resource-fill.bad {
      background: linear-gradient(90deg, var(--alert), rgba(225, 100, 100, 0.2));
      box-shadow: 0 0 12px rgba(225, 100, 100, 0.45);
    }
    .resource-actions {
      display: flex;
      justify-content: space-between;
      align-items: center;
      gap: 8px;
      flex-wrap: wrap;
    }
    .resource-order {
      display: inline-flex;
      align-items: center;
      gap: 6px;
      flex-wrap: wrap;
      justify-content: flex-end;
    }
    .resource-amount {
      width: 36px;
      min-width: 28px;
      text-align: center;
      font-size: 0.7rem;
      letter-spacing: 0.12em;
      text-transform: uppercase;
      color: var(--ink);
      padding: 4px 6px;
      border: 1px solid var(--line);
      border-radius: 4px;
      background: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.35);
    }
    .resource-amount:focus {
      outline: none;
      border-color: var(--accent);
      box-shadow: 0 0 8px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.35);
    }
    .btn-mini.order-step {
      min-width: 30px;
      padding: 4px 6px;
    }
    .btn-mini[disabled] {
      opacity: 0.35;
      pointer-events: none;
    }

    /* Console log */
    .logs {
      display: grid;
      grid-template-columns: 1fr;
      gap: var(--interface-gap);
      min-height: 0;
      overflow: hidden;
    }

    .logbox {
      border: 1px solid var(--line);
      border-radius: 4px;
      background: rgba(0,0,0,0.35);
      padding: 10px;
      min-height: 0;
      overflow: auto;
      -webkit-overflow-scrolling: touch;
      font-size: 0.88rem;
      line-height: 1.35;
      box-shadow: inset 0 0 18px rgba(0,0,0,0.55);
      position: relative;
    }

    .loghead {
      position: sticky;
      top: 0;
      margin: -10px -10px 10px -10px;
      padding: 8px 10px;
      border-bottom: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.06);
      background: rgba(0,0,0,1);
      font-family: var(--font-title);
      letter-spacing: 0.14em;
      text-transform: uppercase;
      font-size: 0.70rem;
      color: var(--muted);
      z-index: 2;
      backdrop-filter: blur(2px);
    }

    .terminal-line { white-space: pre-wrap; word-break: break-word; text-transform: uppercase; }
    .terminal-line.dim { color: var(--muted); }
    .terminal-line.good { color: var(--good); }
    .terminal-line.warn { color: var(--stat); text-shadow: 0 0 6px rgba(0,0,0,0.7), 0 0 10px currentColor; }
    .terminal-line.bad { color: var(--alert); text-shadow: 0 0 6px rgba(0,0,0,0.7), 0 0 10px currentColor; }

    .prompt {
      position: relative;
      display: grid;
      grid-template-columns: auto 1fr auto;
      gap: 10px;
      align-items: center;
    }
    .prompt .ps1 {
      font-family: var(--font-title);
      color: var(--signal);
      letter-spacing: 0.12em;
      text-transform: uppercase;
      font-size: 0.8rem;
      white-space: nowrap;
    }
    #cmd {
      width: 100%;
      user-select: text;
      color: var(--ink);
      border-color: rgba(255,255,255,0.08);
      text-transform: uppercase;
      scroll-margin-bottom: 20px;
    }
    .btn-clr {
      min-width: 50px;
      padding: 8px 12px;
      font-size: 0.75rem;
      letter-spacing: 0.08em;
    }

    /* Ship ID Autocomplete Styles */
    .autocomplete-container {
      position: absolute;
      bottom: 100%;
      left: 0;
      right: 0;
      margin-bottom: 4px;
      z-index: 100;
      pointer-events: none;
    }

    .autocomplete-dropdown {
      background: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.94);
      border: 1px solid var(--line);
      box-shadow: 0 0 16px var(--glow), inset 0 0 0 1px rgba(255,255,255,0.04);
      max-height: 200px;
      overflow-y: auto;
      pointer-events: auto;
      font-family: var(--font-body);
      font-size: 0.85rem;
    }

    .autocomplete-item {
      padding: 8px 12px;
      cursor: pointer;
      color: var(--ink);
      border-bottom: 1px solid var(--line);
      display: grid;
      grid-template-columns: auto 1fr auto;
      gap: 12px;
      align-items: center;
      transition: background-color 0.15s ease;
    }

    .autocomplete-item:last-child {
      border-bottom: none;
    }

    .autocomplete-item:hover,
    .autocomplete-item.selected {
      background: rgba(77, 255, 154, 0.12);
      border-color: var(--signal);
    }

    .autocomplete-item-id {
      font-family: var(--font-title);
      color: var(--signal);
      font-weight: 700;
      letter-spacing: 0.08em;
      text-transform: uppercase;
    }

    .autocomplete-item-info {
      color: var(--muted);
      font-size: 0.75rem;
      text-transform: uppercase;
    }

    .autocomplete-item-state {
      color: var(--ink);
      font-size: 0.7rem;
      padding: 2px 6px;
      border-radius: 2px;
      background: rgba(255,255,255,0.06);
      border: 1px solid var(--line);
    }

    .autocomplete-item-state.good {
      color: var(--good);
      background: rgba(77, 255, 154, 0.08);
    }

    .autocomplete-item-state.warn {
      color: var(--alert);
      background: rgba(225, 100, 100, 0.08);
      text-shadow: 0 0 6px rgba(0,0,0,0.6), 0 0 10px currentColor;
    }

    .autocomplete-preview {
      position: absolute;
      top: 0;
      left: 0;
      right: 0;
      bottom: 0;
      pointer-events: none;
      font-family: inherit;
      font-size: inherit;
      padding: inherit;
      border: inherit;
      color: var(--muted);
      opacity: 0.5;
      text-transform: uppercase;
      z-index: 1;
    }

    #cmd {
      position: relative;
      z-index: 2;
      background: transparent;
    }

    footer {
      display: flex;
      justify-content: space-between;
      align-items: center;
      gap: 10px;
      border-top: 1px solid var(--line);
      padding-top: 10px;
      color: var(--muted);
      font-size: 0.74rem;
      letter-spacing: 0.16em;
      text-transform: uppercase;
      flex-wrap: wrap;
    }
    .footer-right { display: flex; gap: 10px; align-items: center; flex-wrap: wrap; justify-content: flex-end; }
    .hint {
      border: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.08);
      padding: 4px 8px;
      border-radius: 999px;
      color: var(--muted);
      background: rgba(0,0,0,0.18);
      white-space: nowrap;
    }

    @media (max-width: 920px) {
      .brand { min-width: 100%; }
      .header-right { flex: 1 1 100%; justify-items: start; }
      .controls { justify-content: flex-start; }
      .stats { text-align: left; }
      .stat-row { justify-content: flex-start; }
    }

    @media (max-height: 900px) and (min-width: 681px) {
      :root {
        --frame-pad: clamp(8px, 1.6vmin, 14px);
        --interface-gap: clamp(6px, 1.4vmin, 10px);
      }
      header {
        align-items: flex-start;
        padding-bottom: 8px;
      }
      .header-right { gap: 6px; }
      .controls { gap: 8px; }
      select, button, input {
        font-size: 0.78rem;
        padding: 6px 8px;
      }
      .gate-display {
        font-size: 0.78rem;
        padding: 6px 8px;
        min-width: 120px;
      }
      .stats { gap: 2px; }
      .stat-row { gap: 8px; }
    }

    @media (max-width: 780px) {
      :root { --terminal-h: clamp(320px, 44vh, 520px); }
      .interface {
        grid-template-columns: 1fr;
        grid-template-rows: minmax(0, 1fr) minmax(0, 1fr) var(--terminal-h);
        grid-template-areas: "traffic" "systems" "terminal";
      }
      .kv { grid-template-columns: 120px 1fr; }
      .queue { grid-template-rows: minmax(0, 1fr) minmax(0, 1fr); }
      .logs { grid-template-columns: 1fr; }

      /* Smaller chevrons on mobile */
      .panel-chevron,
      .subsection-chevron {
        font-size: 0.65em;
      }
    }

    @media (max-width: 420px) {
      th:nth-child(1), td:nth-child(1) { width: 98px; }
      th:nth-child(2), td:nth-child(2) { width: 70px; }
      th:last-child, td:last-child { width: 140px; }
      .row-actions { flex-wrap: wrap; gap: 4px; }
      .btn-mini { min-width: 40px; padding: 4px 6px; }
      :root { --frame-pad: 10px; }
    }

    @media (max-width: 680px) {
      body {
        height: auto;
        min-height: 100dvh;
        overflow-y: auto;
      }
      #game-container {
        height: auto;
        min-height: 100dvh;
        grid-template-rows: auto auto auto;
      }
      header { padding-bottom: 8px; }
      .interface {
        grid-template-rows: auto auto auto;
      }
      .scroll {
        overflow: visible;
      }
      table {
        table-layout: auto;
        font-size: 0.82rem;
      }
      thead { display: none; }
      tbody, tr, td { display: block; width: 100%; }
      tr {
        border: 1px solid var(--line);
        border-radius: 6px;
        padding: 8px 8px 6px;
        margin-bottom: 8px;
        background: rgba(0,0,0,0.18);
      }
      td {
        border: none;
        padding: 4px 0;
        text-overflow: clip;
      }
      td::before {
        content: attr(data-label);
        display: block;
        font-size: 0.65rem;
        text-transform: uppercase;
        letter-spacing: 0.14em;
        color: var(--muted);
        margin-bottom: 2px;
      }
      td.code { white-space: nowrap; }
      th:last-child, td:last-child,
      th:nth-child(2), td:nth-child(2),
      th:nth-child(1), td:nth-child(1) { width: auto; }
      .row-actions { justify-content: flex-start; flex-wrap: wrap; }
      .btn-mini { min-width: 64px; padding: 6px 8px; }
      .controls, .stats { width: 100%; }
      .controls { gap: 8px; }
      .ctl { text-align: left; }
      select, button, input { font-size: 0.9rem; padding: 10px 12px; }
      .gate-display { font-size: 0.9rem; padding: 10px 12px; }
      .prompt { grid-template-columns: 1fr auto; }
      .prompt .ps1 { white-space: normal; grid-column: 1 / -1; }
      footer { gap: 6px; }
      .hint { white-space: normal; }
      #severed-overlay { padding: 16px; }
      .severed-card {
        max-height: calc(100dvh - 32px);
        padding: 20px;
        gap: 14px;
      }
      .severed-grid {
        grid-template-columns: 1fr;
        gap: 10px 18px;
      }
      .severed-stat { padding: 8px 10px; }
      .severed-actions button { min-width: 160px; }
      .logbox {
        max-height: min(42vh, 360px);
      }
      .help-row { grid-template-columns: 1fr; gap: 4px; }
      #systems .sys-grid {
        overflow-x: hidden;
        padding-right: 0;
      }
      #systems .sys-block,
      #systems .subsection-content,
      #systems .kv,
      #systems .status-row {
        min-width: 0;
      }
      #systems .kv {
        grid-template-columns: minmax(90px, 38%) minmax(0, 1fr);
      }
      #systems .kv .v,
      #systems .status-name {
        min-width: 0;
        overflow-wrap: anywhere;
      }
      #systems .status-row {
        grid-template-columns: minmax(0, 1fr) auto;
        gap: 6px 10px;
        align-items: center;
      }
      #systems .status-right {
        justify-content: flex-end;
        row-gap: 4px;
        max-width: none;
        width: auto;
      }
      #systems .status-meta {
        white-space: normal;
        text-align: right;
      }
      #systems .relay-row .status-name,
      #systems .relay-row .relay-hb {
        white-space: nowrap;
        overflow-wrap: normal;
        word-break: normal;
      }
      #systems .relay-row {
        grid-template-columns: minmax(0, 1fr) auto;
        align-items: center;
      }
      #systems .relay-row .status-right {
        flex-wrap: wrap;
        max-width: none;
      }
      #systems .resource-head {
        flex-wrap: wrap;
      }
      #systems #corridor-meta {
        white-space: normal;
        text-align: right;
        font-size: 0.6rem;
      }
    }

    /* Mobile landscape mode - handle short viewport heights */
    @media (max-height: 500px) and (orientation: landscape) {
      body {
        height: auto;
        min-height: 100dvh;
        overflow-y: auto;
      }
      #game-container {
        height: auto;
        min-height: 100dvh;
        grid-template-rows: auto auto auto;
      }
      .interface {
        grid-template-rows: auto auto auto;
      }
      .scroll {
        overflow: visible;
      }
      header { padding-bottom: 8px; }
    }

    /* VFX LOW mode - reduced animations and effects for better performance */
    body.vfx-low .status-bar::before,
    body.vfx-low .gate-display::before,
    body.vfx-low .loading-progress {
      box-shadow: none !important;
    }

    body.vfx-low button,
    body.vfx-low select,
    body.vfx-low .relay-btn,
    body.vfx-low .logline {
      box-shadow: none !important;
    }
    body.vfx-low button.btn-clearance {
      animation: none !important;
    }

    body.vfx-low button:hover,
    body.vfx-low select:hover,
    body.vfx-low .relay-btn:hover {
      box-shadow: none !important;
    }

    body.vfx-low .beacon,
    body.vfx-low .beacon-inner {
      animation: none !important;
    }

    body.vfx-low .btn-danger {
      animation: none !important;
    }

    body.vfx-low .ack-strip {
      animation: none !important;
    }

    body.vfx-low .relay-ping {
      animation: none !important;
    }

    body.vfx-low .gate-ping::after {
      animation: none !important;
    }

    body.vfx-low .exposure-critical {
      animation: none !important;
    }

    body.vfx-low .congested-pulse {
      animation: none !important;
    }

    body.vfx-low .hb-indicator.health-blink-positive,
    body.vfx-low .hb-indicator.health-blink-warn {
      animation: none !important;
    }
    body.vfx-low .hb-indicator.health-blink-positive::after,
    body.vfx-low .hb-indicator.health-blink-warn::after {
      animation: none !important;
      opacity: 0 !important;
    }

    body.vfx-low .help-panel,
    body.vfx-low .confirm-overlay {
      backdrop-filter: none !important;
      background: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.95) !important;
    }

    body.vfx-low @keyframes startFill,
    body.vfx-low @keyframes btnErrorFlash,
    body.vfx-low @keyframes beaconPulse,
    body.vfx-low @keyframes gateAlertPulse,
    body.vfx-low @keyframes pulse-urgent,
    body.vfx-low @keyframes ackPulse,
    body.vfx-low @keyframes relayPingPulse,
    body.vfx-low @keyframes headerAckPulse,
    body.vfx-low @keyframes headerExposurePulse,
    body.vfx-low @keyframes headerGateCriticalPulse,
    body.vfx-low @keyframes headerCongestedPulse,
    body.vfx-low @keyframes headerRelayPingPulse,
    body.vfx-low @keyframes headerPingPulse,
    body.vfx-low @keyframes healthBlinkPositive,
    body.vfx-low @keyframes healthBlinkWarn {
      from, to { opacity: 1; transform: none; }
    }
  </style>
</head>

<body>
  <div class="crt-overlay"></div>
  <div id="start-overlay" aria-hidden="false">
    <div class="start-controls">
      <button id="btn-start-options" aria-expanded="false" aria-controls="options-panel">OPTIONS</button>
      <button id="btn-start-help" aria-expanded="false" aria-controls="help-panel">HELP</button>
      <button id="btn-start-profile" aria-expanded="false" aria-controls="profile-panel">PROFILE</button>
      <button id="btn-start-fullscreen" class="btn-fullscreen" aria-label="Toggle fullscreen mode" aria-pressed="false">⛶</button>
    </div>
    <div class="start-card">
      <div class="start-sub">Awaiting Operator Input</div>
      <div id="start-name-slot" class="start-name-slot">
        <div id="start-name-label" class="start-name-label" role="button" tabindex="0">USER</div>
        <input id="start-name-input" class="start-name-input" type="text" maxlength="24" aria-label="Operator callsign" autocomplete="off" />
      </div>
      <div id="start-clearance" class="start-clearance" style="display: none;">CLEARANCE-1</div>
      <button id="btn-start">START</button>
      <button id="btn-shift-time">SHIFT DURATION</button>
      <button id="btn-start-resume">LOAD FROM FILE</button>
      <button id="btn-data-reset">RESET</button>
      <div id="start-shift-error" class="start-shift-error"></div>
      <input id="start-resume-file" type="file" accept=".tqegate,application/json" hidden>
      <div id="start-loading-text" class="start-loading-text">LOADING: <span id="start-loading-name"></span><span class="start-loading-dots"></span></div>
      <div class="start-status" aria-live="polite">INITIALIZING...</div>
      <div class="start-progress" aria-hidden="true">
        <div class="start-progress-fill"></div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>

  <div id="confirm-data-reset-overlay" aria-hidden="true">
    <div class="confirm-card" role="dialog" aria-modal="true" aria-labelledby="confirm-data-reset-title">
      <div id="confirm-data-reset-title" class="confirm-title">RESET GATE?</div>
      <div class="confirm-actions">
        <button id="btn-data-reset-confirm" class="btn-danger">YES</button>
        <button id="btn-data-reset-cancel">NO</button>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>

  <div id="confirm-full-reset-overlay" aria-hidden="true">
    <div class="confirm-card" role="dialog" aria-modal="true" aria-labelledby="confirm-full-reset-title">
      <div id="confirm-full-reset-title" class="confirm-title" style="color: rgba(255,100,100,0.95);">⚠ FULL DATA WIPE ⚠</div>
      <div class="confirm-body">
        <p style="color: rgba(255,100,100,0.9); font-weight: bold;">WARNING: This will permanently delete ALL saved data!</p>
        <p>This includes:</p>
        <ul style="margin: 8px 0; padding-left: 20px;">
          <li>All game progress and gate states</li>
          <li>Unlocked themes</li>
          <li>Settings and preferences (audio, VFX, zoom, etc.)</li>
          <li>Any other saved data</li>
        </ul>
        <p style="margin-top: 12px;">This action <strong>CANNOT BE UNDONE</strong>. Are you absolutely sure?</p>
      </div>
      <div class="confirm-actions">
        <button id="btn-full-reset-cancel">Cancel</button>
        <button id="btn-full-reset-confirm" class="btn-danger">Wipe All Data</button>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>

  <div id="confirm-clearance-overlay" aria-hidden="true">
    <div class="confirm-card" role="dialog" aria-modal="true" aria-labelledby="confirm-clearance-title" style="width: min(520px, 90vw);">
      <div id="confirm-clearance-title" class="confirm-title">UPGRADE CLEARANCE?</div>
      <div class="confirm-body" style="font-size: 13px; line-height: 1.6;">
        <p style="margin: 0 0 10px 0;"><strong>UPGRADE CLEARANCE</strong> is the &gt;GATE_CONTROL prestige.</p>
        <p style="margin: 0 0 10px 0;">Confirming will reset all achievements and unlocked themes, but will add a new CLEARANCE LEVEL.</p>
        <p style="margin: 0;">This can be done multiple times whenever all achievements (excluding hidden) and themes are fully unlocked.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="confirm-actions">
        <button id="btn-clearance-confirm" class="btn-clearance" style="min-width: 160px;">CONFIRM</button>
        <button id="btn-clearance-cancel">CANCEL</button>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>

  <div id="shift-time-modal-overlay" aria-hidden="true">
    <div class="confirm-card" role="dialog" aria-modal="true" aria-labelledby="shift-time-modal-title">
      <div id="shift-time-modal-title" class="confirm-title">SELECT SHIFT DURATION</div>
      <div style="margin: 6px 0 12px; font-size: 12px; color: var(--muted); text-align: center;">
        Shifts under 2 hours run with adjusted pacing and timer lengths. Achievement progress is normalized.
      </div>
      <div class="shift-time-presets">
        <button class="shift-time-preset-btn" data-minutes="15">15 MIN</button>
        <button class="shift-time-preset-btn" data-minutes="30">30 MIN</button>
        <button class="shift-time-preset-btn" data-minutes="60">1 HR</button>
        <button class="shift-time-preset-btn" data-minutes="120">2 HR</button>
        <button class="shift-time-preset-btn" data-minutes="240">4 HR</button>
        <button class="shift-time-preset-btn" data-minutes="480">8 HR</button>
        <button class="shift-time-preset-btn" data-minutes="720">12 HR</button>
        <button class="shift-time-preset-btn" data-minutes="1440">24 HR</button>
        <div class="shift-time-preset-wrapper">
          <button class="shift-time-preset-btn" data-mode="unlimited">UNLIMITED</button>
          <div class="shift-time-preset-subtext">Timer runs forever until SEVER or RESET</div>
        </div>
        <div class="shift-time-preset-wrapper">
          <button class="shift-time-preset-btn" data-mode="endurance">ENDURANCE</button>
          <div class="shift-time-preset-subtext">UNLIMITED mode with saves disabled</div>
        </div>
      </div>
      <div class="shift-time-custom">
        <div class="shift-time-custom-label">CUSTOM DURATION</div>
        <div class="shift-time-custom-input-wrapper">
          <input id="shift-time-custom-hours" type="number" min="0" max="24" placeholder="00" maxlength="2" class="shift-time-custom-input" aria-label="Hours" />
          <span class="shift-time-custom-separator">h</span>
          <input id="shift-time-custom-minutes" type="number" min="0" max="59" placeholder="00" maxlength="2" class="shift-time-custom-input" aria-label="Minutes" />
          <span class="shift-time-custom-separator">m</span>
        </div>
        <div id="shift-time-error" class="shift-time-error"></div>
      </div>
      <div class="confirm-actions">
        <button id="btn-shift-time-confirm">CONFIRM</button>
        <button id="btn-shift-time-cancel">CANCEL</button>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>

  <div id="severed-overlay">
    <div class="severed-card">
      <div class="severed-title">Gate Connection Severed</div>
      <div class="severed-sub">Previous Gate Summary</div>
      <div class="severed-stats-container">
        <div class="severed-grid">
          <div class="severed-stat">
            <span class="label">Gate</span>
            <span id="severed-gate" class="value">GATE-00</span>
          </div>
          <div class="severed-stat">
            <span class="label">Time of Loss</span>
            <span id="severed-time" class="value">00:00:00</span>
          </div>
          <div class="severed-stat">
            <span class="label">Cause of Loss</span>
            <span id="severed-cause" class="value">Unknown</span>
          </div>
          <div class="severed-stat">
            <span class="label">Shift Time</span>
            <span id="severed-shift" class="value">00:00:00</span>
          </div>
          <div class="severed-stat">
            <span class="label">Ships Approved</span>
            <span id="severed-approved" class="value">0</span>
          </div>
          <div class="severed-stat">
            <span class="label">Ships Denied</span>
            <span id="severed-denied" class="value">0</span>
          </div>
          <div class="severed-stat">
            <span class="label">Wage</span>
            <span id="severed-wage" class="value">0 credits</span>
          </div>
          <div class="severed-stat">
            <span class="label">Final Score (per 10 min)</span>
            <span id="severed-score" class="value score-highlight">0</span>
          </div>
          <div class="severed-stat severed-full-width" id="severed-mode-display" style="display:none;">
            <span class="label">Mode</span>
            <span id="severed-mode" class="value">NORMAL</span>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
      <div id="severed-achievements-container" style="display:none;"></div>
      <div class="severed-actions">
        <button id="btn-restart">Restart Gate</button>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>

  <div id="host-disconnect-overlay">
    <div class="host-disconnect-card">
      <div class="host-disconnect-title">REMOTE CONNECTION CLOSED</div>
      <div class="host-disconnect-sub">HOST DISCONNECTED</div>
      <div class="host-disconnect-actions">
        <button id="btn-host-disconnect-return">RETURN TO START</button>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>

  <div id="shiftcomplete-overlay">
    <div class="shiftcomplete-card">
      <div class="shiftcomplete-title">Shift Complete</div>
      <div class="shiftcomplete-sub">Shift Summary</div>
      <div class="shiftcomplete-grid">
        <div class="shiftcomplete-stat">
          <span class="label">Gate</span>
          <span id="shiftcomplete-gate" class="value">GATE-00</span>
        </div>
        <div class="shiftcomplete-stat">
          <span class="label">Completion Time</span>
          <span id="shiftcomplete-time" class="value">00:00:00</span>
        </div>
        <div class="shiftcomplete-stat">
          <span class="label">Shift Duration</span>
          <span id="shiftcomplete-shift" class="value">08:00:00</span>
        </div>
        <div class="shiftcomplete-stat">
          <span class="label">Gate Health</span>
          <span id="shiftcomplete-health" class="value">OPERATIONAL</span>
        </div>
        <div class="shiftcomplete-stat">
          <span class="label">Ships Approved</span>
          <span id="shiftcomplete-approved" class="value">0</span>
        </div>
        <div class="shiftcomplete-stat">
          <span class="label">Ships Denied</span>
          <span id="shiftcomplete-denied" class="value">0</span>
        </div>
        <div class="shiftcomplete-stat">
          <span class="label">Wage Earned</span>
          <span id="shiftcomplete-wage" class="value">0 credits</span>
        </div>
        <div class="shiftcomplete-stat">
          <span class="label">Final Score (per 10 min)</span>
          <span id="shiftcomplete-score" class="value score-highlight">0</span>
        </div>
        <div class="shiftcomplete-stat shiftcomplete-full-width" id="shiftcomplete-mode-display" style="display:none;">
          <span class="label">Mode</span>
          <span id="shiftcomplete-mode" class="value">NORMAL</span>
        </div>
      </div>
      <div id="shiftcomplete-theme-unlock" style="display:none; margin: 15px 0; padding: 15px; border: 2px solid var(--green); text-align: center;">
        <div style="font-weight: bold; font-size: 1.1em; margin-bottom: 5px;">THEME UNLOCKED</div>
        <div id="shiftcomplete-theme-name" style="font-size: 1.3em; color: var(--green);"></div>
      </div>
      <div id="shiftcomplete-achievements-container" style="display:none;"></div>
      <div class="shiftcomplete-actions">
        <button id="btn-shiftcomplete-continue">Continue Shift</button>
        <button id="btn-shiftcomplete-reset" class="btn-danger">Reset Gate</button>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>

  <div id="confirm-reset-overlay" aria-hidden="true">
    <div class="confirm-card" role="dialog" aria-modal="true" aria-labelledby="confirm-reset-title">
      <div id="confirm-reset-title" class="confirm-title">Confirm Gate Reset</div>
      <div class="confirm-body">
        Resetting will generate a new gate and clear all queues, statuses, and logs. Proceed?
      </div>
      <div class="confirm-actions">
        <button id="btn-reset-cancel">Cancel</button>
        <button id="btn-reset-confirm" class="btn-danger">Reset</button>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>

  <div id="break-modal-overlay" aria-hidden="true">
    <div class="confirm-card break-modal-card" role="dialog" aria-modal="true" aria-labelledby="break-modal-title">
      <div id="break-modal-title" class="confirm-title">OPERATOR BREAK REQUEST</div>
      <div class="confirm-body break-modal-body">
        <p>WARNING: Break time is DEDUCTED from your wage at <strong>25 CR/MIN</strong>.</p>
        <p>During break, all gate operations are SUSPENDED. Relays remain silent. Ship timers freeze. Your shift clock pauses.</p>
        <p>Select break duration (minutes):</p>
        <div class="break-duration-buttons">
          <button class="break-duration-btn" data-minutes="1">1 MIN<br><span class="break-cost">-25 CR</span></button>
          <button class="break-duration-btn" data-minutes="2">2 MIN<br><span class="break-cost">-50 CR</span></button>
          <button class="break-duration-btn" data-minutes="3">3 MIN<br><span class="break-cost">-75 CR</span></button>
          <button class="break-duration-btn" data-minutes="5">5 MIN<br><span class="break-cost">-125 CR</span></button>
          <button class="break-duration-btn" data-minutes="10">10 MIN<br><span class="break-cost">-250 CR</span></button>
          <button class="break-duration-btn" data-minutes="15">15 MIN<br><span class="break-cost">-375 CR</span></button>
        </div>
        <div id="break-insufficient-funds" class="break-error" style="display: none;">
          INSUFFICIENT FUNDS. Current wage: <span id="break-current-wage">0</span> CR
        </div>
      </div>
      <div class="confirm-actions">
        <button id="btn-break-cancel">CANCEL</button>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>

  <div id="purchase-modal-overlay" aria-hidden="true" style="position: fixed; inset: 0; display: none; align-items: center; justify-content: center; background: radial-gradient(circle at center, rgba(10, 6, 8, 0.92) 0%, rgba(0,0,0,0.98) 70%); z-index: 215;">
    <div class="confirm-card" role="dialog" aria-modal="true" aria-labelledby="purchase-modal-title" style="width: min(520px, 90vw);">
      <div id="purchase-modal-title" class="confirm-title">CONFIRM PURCHASE</div>
      <div class="confirm-body" style="font-size: 13px; line-height: 1.6;">
        <div id="purchase-modal-details" style="margin-bottom: 16px;"></div>
        <div id="purchase-modal-summary" style="padding: 12px; background: rgba(255,255,255,0.03); border: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.1); border-radius: 4px; font-family: 'Courier New', monospace; font-size: 12px;"></div>
      </div>
      <div class="confirm-actions">
        <button id="btn-purchase-confirm" class="btn-success" style="min-width: 120px;">CONFIRM</button>
        <button id="btn-purchase-cancel" class="btn-secondary" style="min-width: 120px;">CANCEL</button>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>

  <div id="upgrade-modal-overlay" aria-hidden="true" style="position: fixed; inset: 0; display: none; align-items: center; justify-content: center; background: radial-gradient(circle at center, rgba(10, 6, 8, 0.92) 0%, rgba(0,0,0,0.98) 70%); z-index: 215;">
    <div class="confirm-card" role="dialog" aria-modal="true" aria-labelledby="upgrade-modal-title" style="width: min(520px, 90vw);">
      <div id="upgrade-modal-title" class="confirm-title">CONFIRM UPGRADE</div>
      <div class="confirm-body" style="font-size: 13px; line-height: 1.6;">
        <div id="upgrade-modal-details" style="margin-bottom: 16px;"></div>
        <div id="upgrade-modal-summary" style="padding: 12px; background: rgba(255,255,255,0.03); border: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.1); border-radius: 4px; font-family: 'Courier New', monospace; font-size: 12px;"></div>
      </div>
      <div class="confirm-actions">
        <button id="btn-upgrade-confirm" class="btn-success" style="min-width: 120px;">CONFIRM</button>
        <button id="btn-upgrade-cancel" class="btn-secondary" style="min-width: 120px;">CANCEL</button>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>

  <div id="purge-modal-overlay" aria-hidden="true" style="position: fixed; inset: 0; display: none; align-items: center; justify-content: center; background: radial-gradient(circle at center, rgba(10, 6, 8, 0.92) 0%, rgba(0,0,0,0.98) 70%); z-index: 215;">
    <div class="confirm-card" role="dialog" aria-modal="true" aria-labelledby="purge-modal-title" style="width: min(460px, 90vw);">
      <div id="purge-modal-title" class="confirm-title">CONFIRM PURGE</div>
      <div class="confirm-body" style="font-size: 13px; line-height: 1.6;">
        <p style="margin: 0 0 12px 0;">Clear low-priority traffic from the ship queue?</p>
        <div style="padding: 12px; background: rgba(255,255,255,0.03); border: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.1); border-radius: 4px; font-family: 'Courier New', monospace; font-size: 12px;">
          <div style="display: grid; grid-template-columns: auto 1fr auto; gap: 8px 12px; align-items: baseline;">
            <div>COST:</div>
            <div></div>
            <div style="text-align: right; color: var(--alert);">-10% FUEL</div>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
      <div class="confirm-actions">
        <button id="btn-purge-confirm" class="btn-success" style="min-width: 120px;">CONFIRM</button>
        <button id="btn-purge-cancel" class="btn-secondary" style="min-width: 120px;">CANCEL</button>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>

  <div id="stresstest-modal-overlay" aria-hidden="true" style="position: fixed; inset: 0; display: none; align-items: center; justify-content: center; background: radial-gradient(circle at center, rgba(10, 6, 8, 0.92) 0%, rgba(0,0,0,0.98) 70%); z-index: 215;">
    <div class="confirm-card" role="dialog" aria-modal="true" aria-labelledby="stresstest-modal-title" style="width: min(460px, 90vw);">
      <div id="stresstest-modal-title" class="confirm-title">CONFIRM STRESS TEST</div>
      <div class="confirm-body" style="font-size: 13px; line-height: 1.6;">
        <p style="margin: 0 0 12px 0;">Initiate full-spectrum diagnostic protocol?</p>
        <div style="padding: 12px; background: rgba(255,60,60,0.08); border: 1px solid rgba(255,80,80,0.3); border-radius: 4px; font-family: 'Courier New', monospace; font-size: 12px; line-height: 1.7;">
          <div style="color: var(--warn); margin-bottom: 8px; font-weight: bold;">⚠ ADVISORY</div>
          <div style="color: rgba(255,255,255,0.85);">Load-testing protocols may expose weakened subsystems to cascading failure. Systems operating near tolerance thresholds will degrade under diagnostic stress.</div>
        </div>
        <p style="margin: 12px 0 0 0; font-size: 11px; color: rgba(255,255,255,0.5); font-style: italic;">Recommended for pre-emptive maintenance scheduling during low-traffic windows.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="confirm-actions">
        <button id="btn-stresstest-confirm" class="btn-success" style="min-width: 120px;">PROCEED</button>
        <button id="btn-stresstest-cancel" class="btn-secondary" style="min-width: 120px;">ABORT</button>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>

  <div id="break-screen-overlay" aria-hidden="true">
    <div class="break-screen-card">
      <div class="break-screen-title">BREAK</div>
      <div class="break-screen-timer" id="break-timer-display">00:00</div>
      <div class="break-screen-sub">Gate operations suspended</div>
    </div>
  </div>

  <div id="game-container">
    <header>
      <div class="brand">
        <div class="breadcrumbs"><a href="../">Homepage</a> // Gate Control Terminal</div>
        <h1>Gate Control Terminal</h1>
        <div id="connection-indicator" class="sub connection-indicator">
          <span class="connection-light"></span>
          <span id="connection-text">OFFLINE MODE</span>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="header-right">
        <div class="controls">
          <div class="ctl">
            <label>Gate Node</label>
            <div id="gate-display" class="gate-display">GATE-00</div>
          </div>
          <button id="btn-break" aria-label="Take a paid break">BREAK - 25CR/MIN</button>
          <button id="btn-menu" aria-expanded="false" aria-controls="menu-panel">MENU</button>
          <button id="btn-fullscreen" class="btn-fullscreen" aria-label="Toggle fullscreen mode" aria-pressed="false">⛶</button>
          <button id="header-collapse-btn" class="header-toggle-btn header-collapse-btn" aria-label="Collapse header">▲ HIDE</button>
        </div>

        <input id="resume-file" type="file" accept=".tqegate,application/json" hidden>

        <div class="stats">
          <div class="stat-row">
            <span id="operator-slot" class="operator-slot">
              <span id="operator-label" class="stat-label operator-label" role="button" tabindex="0">Operator</span>
              <input id="operator-input" class="operator-input" type="text" maxlength="24" aria-label="Operator callsign" autocomplete="off" />
            </span>
            <span class="stat-divider">/</span>
            <span class="stat-label">Shift Time</span>
            <span id="shift-time" class="stat-value">00:00:00</span>
            <span class="stat-divider">/</span>
            <span class="stat-label">Wage</span>
            <span id="shift-wage" class="stat-value">0 credits</span>
          </div>
          <div class="stat-row">
            <span class="stat-label">Alerts</span>
            <span id="alert-count" class="stat-value">0</span>
            <span class="stat-divider">/</span>
            <span class="stat-label">Overall Status</span>
            <span id="overall-systems-pill" class="pill ok">ALL SYSTEMS NOMINAL</span>
          </div>
          <div id="overall-systems-detail" class="overall-summary stat-summary">NO ACTIVE ISSUES</div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </header>

    <div class="interface">
      <!-- TRAFFIC -->
      <section id="traffic" class="panel">
        <div class="label panel-header" data-panel="traffic">
          <span class="panel-chevron">▼</span>
          <span>Traffic Queue</span>
          <button class="btn-maximize" data-maximize="traffic" aria-label="Maximize Traffic panel">⛶</button>
        </div>

        <div class="panel-content">
        <div class="queue">
          <div class="queue-section">
            <div class="queue-head subsection-header" data-panel="traffic-inbound">
              <div class="queue-title">
                <span class="subsection-chevron">▼</span>
                <span>Inbound</span>
              </div>
              <div id="inbound-meta" class="queue-meta">—</div>
            </div>

            <div class="subsection-content">
            <div class="scroll">
              <table>
                <thead>
                  <tr>
                    <th>Id</th>
                    <th>Eta</th>
                    <th>Type</th>
                    <th>Cargo</th>
                    <th>Status</th>
                    <th style="text-align:right;">Action</th>
                  </tr>
                </thead>
                <tbody id="inbound-body"></tbody>
              </table>
            </div>
            </div>
          </div>

          <div class="queue-section">
            <div class="queue-head subsection-header" data-panel="traffic-outbound">
              <div class="queue-title">
                <span class="subsection-chevron">▼</span>
                <span>Outbound</span>
              </div>
              <div id="outbound-meta" class="queue-meta">—</div>
            </div>

            <div class="subsection-content">
            <div class="scroll">
              <table>
                <thead>
                  <tr>
                    <th>Id</th>
                    <th>Eta</th>
                    <th>Type</th>
                    <th>Cargo</th>
                    <th>Status</th>
                    <th style="text-align:right;">Action</th>
                  </tr>
                </thead>
                <tbody id="outbound-body"></tbody>
              </table>
            </div>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>
        </div>
      </section>

      <!-- SYSTEMS -->
      <section id="systems" class="panel">
        <div class="label panel-header" data-panel="systems">
          <span class="panel-chevron">▼</span>
          <span>Systems</span>
          <button class="btn-maximize" data-maximize="systems" aria-label="Maximize Systems panel">⛶</button>
        </div>

        <div class="panel-content">
        <div class="sys-grid">
          <div class="sys-block">
            <div class="queue-head subsection-header" data-panel="systems-gate">
              <div class="queue-title">
                <span class="subsection-chevron">▼</span>
                <span>Gate Systems</span>
              </div>
              <div class="gate-head-pills">
                <div id="beacon-pill" class="pill ok beacon-pill">BEACON ONLINE</div>
                <div id="gate-health-pill" class="pill ok">OK</div>
              </div>
            </div>

            <div class="subsection-content">
            <div class="kv">
              <div class="k">Node</div><div id="kv-node" class="v">—</div>
              <div class="k">Beacon Array</div><div id="kv-beacon" class="v">—</div>
              <div class="k">Alignment</div><div id="kv-align" class="v">—</div>
              <div class="k">Sync State</div><div id="kv-sync" class="v">—</div>
              <div id="gate-alert-label" class="k" style="display: none;">System Failure Warning: </div><div id="gate-alert-timer" class="v gate-alert-timer dim" style="display: none;">STANDBY</div>
            </div>
            </div>
          </div>

          <div class="sys-block">
            <div class="queue-head subsection-header" data-panel="systems-corridor">
              <div class="queue-title">
                <span class="subsection-chevron">▼</span>
                <span>Corridor Links</span>
              </div>
              <div id="corridor-meta" class="queue-meta">—</div>
            </div>
            <div class="subsection-content">
            <div id="corridor-list" class="kv"></div>
            </div>
          </div>

          <div class="sys-block">
            <div class="queue-head subsection-header" data-panel="systems-facility">
              <div class="queue-title">
                <span class="subsection-chevron">▼</span>
                <span>Facility Subsystems</span>
              </div>
              <div id="facility-meta" class="queue-meta">—</div>
            </div>
            <div class="subsection-content">
            <div id="facility-list" class="status-list"></div>
            <div class="label-mini">Work Orders</div>
            <div id="workorder-list" class="status-list"></div>
            <div class="label-mini">Repairs <span id="repair-meta" class="label-meta">STANDBY</span></div>
            <div id="repair-list" class="status-list"></div>
            </div>
          </div>

          <div class="sys-block">
            <div class="queue-head subsection-header" data-panel="systems-resources">
              <div class="queue-title">
                <span class="subsection-chevron">▼</span>
                <span>Resources</span>
              </div>
              <div id="resource-meta" class="queue-meta">SYSTEM LEVELS</div>
            </div>
            <div class="subsection-content">
            <div id="resource-list" class="resource-list"></div>
            </div>
          </div>

          <div class="sys-block">
            <div class="queue-head subsection-header" data-panel="systems-concourse">
              <div class="queue-title">
                <span class="subsection-chevron">▼</span>
                <span>Concourse / Docking</span>
              </div>
              <div id="concourse-pill" class="pill ok">QUIET</div>
            </div>
            <div class="subsection-content">
            <div class="kv">
              <div class="k">Concourse Status</div><div id="concourse-status" class="v">—</div>
            </div>
            <div id="dock-list" class="status-list"></div>
            <div style="margin-top: 8px; text-align: right;">
              <button id="btn-purchase-dock" class="btn-mini hold" style="opacity: 0.7;">PURCHASE DOCK</button>
            </div>
            </div>
          </div>

          <div class="sys-block">
            <div class="queue-head subsection-header" data-panel="systems-relays">
              <div class="queue-title">
                <span class="subsection-chevron">▼</span>
                <span>Repeater Relays</span>
              </div>
              <div class="queue-meta">LOCAL RELAY NETWORK</div>
            </div>
            <div class="subsection-content">
            <div id="relay-list" class="status-list"></div>
            <div style="margin-top: 8px; text-align: right;">
              <button id="btn-purchase-relay" class="btn-mini hold" style="opacity: 0.7;">PURCHASE RELAY</button>
            </div>
            </div>
          </div>

          <div id="gate-network-panel" class="sys-block" style="display: none;">
            <div class="queue-head subsection-header collapsed" data-panel="systems-gatenetwork">
              <div class="queue-title">
                <span class="subsection-chevron">▼</span>
                <span>Gate Network</span>
              </div>
              <div class="queue-meta">CONNECTED OPERATORS</div>
            </div>
            <div class="subsection-content">
            <div id="gate-network-list" class="status-list"></div>
            </div>
          </div>

          <div class="sys-block">
            <div class="queue-head subsection-header" data-panel="systems-maintenance">
              <div class="queue-title">
                <span class="subsection-chevron">▼</span>
                <span>Maintenance</span>
              </div>
              <div class="queue-meta">AUTHORIZED COMMANDS</div>
            </div>
            <div class="subsection-content">
            <div class="sys-actions">
              <button id="btn-realign">REALIGN</button>
              <button id="btn-reset">RESYNC</button>
              <button id="btn-purge">PURGE</button>
              <button id="btn-scan">SCAN</button>
              <button id="btn-stresstest">STRESS TEST</button>
            </div>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>
        </div>
      </section>

      <!-- TERMINAL -->
      <section id="terminal" class="panel">
        <div class="label panel-header" data-panel="terminal">
          <span class="panel-chevron">▼</span>
          <span>Operator Console</span>
          <button class="btn-maximize" data-maximize="terminal" aria-label="Maximize Terminal panel">⛶</button>
        </div>

        <div class="panel-content">
        <div class="logs">
          <div id="console-log" class="logbox" aria-label="Console output">
            <div class="loghead subsection-header" data-panel="terminal-console">
              <span class="subsection-chevron">▼</span>
              <span>Console</span>
            </div>
            <div class="subsection-content"></div>
          </div>
        </div>

        <div class="prompt">
          <div id="ps1" class="ps1">GATE-—&gt;</div>
          <input id="cmd" type="text" placeholder="HELP / STATUS / DETAIL V-9012 / APPROVE V-9012 ..." autocomplete="off" spellcheck="false">
          <!-- Ship ID Autocomplete -->
          <div id="autocomplete-container" class="autocomplete-container" style="display: none;">
            <div id="autocomplete-dropdown" class="autocomplete-dropdown"></div>
          </div>
          <div id="autocomplete-preview" class="autocomplete-preview"></div>
          <button id="btn-clr" class="btn-clr">CLR</button>
        </div>
        </div>

        <!-- Virtual Keyboard for Gamepad Input -->
        <div id="virtual-keyboard" class="virtual-keyboard">
          <div class="vk-header">
            <span>CONSOLE INPUT</span>
            <span class="vk-hint">[B] Cancel | [A] Select</span>
          </div>
          <div class="vk-display">
            <span id="vk-input-display"></span>
          </div>
          <div class="vk-grid" id="vk-grid">
            <!-- Keys generated dynamically -->
          </div>
        </div>
      </section>
    </div>

    <footer>
      <div>CORRIDOR NAVIGATIONAL AUTHORITY // GATE ACCESS TERMINAL // TERMINAL STATUS: CONNECTED // TIME: <span id="data-age">00:00</span></div>
      <div class="footer-right">
        <button id="header-expand-btn" class="header-toggle-btn" aria-label="Show header">▼ SHOW</button>
        <span class="hint">ENTER: RUN</span>
        <span class="hint">↑: HISTORY</span>
        <span class="hint">ESC: CLEAR</span>
        <button id="btn-fullscreen-footer" class="btn-fullscreen" aria-label="Toggle fullscreen mode" aria-pressed="false">⛶</button>
      </div>
    </footer>
  </div>

  <div id="help-panel" class="help-panel" aria-hidden="true">
    <div class="help-head">
      <div class="help-title">Help // Operator Quickstart</div>
      <div class="help-sub">Local reference only</div>
    </div>
    <div class="help-body">
      <div class="help-section">
        <div class="help-section-title">1. What You're Looking At</div>
        <div class="help-row">
          <div class="help-key">Your Role</div>
          <div>You manage a gate; a transit hub where ships travel between distant locations. Ships arrive constantly requesting passage. Your job is to process them safely while keeping gate systems operational.</div>
        </div>
        <div class="help-row">
          <div class="help-key">What is a Gate?</div>
          <div>A gate is a transit hub built to stabilize corridor routes and connect locations throughout the galaxy. Ships use gates to jump between distant star systems that would otherwise be unreachable. Your gate has multiple systems (power, docking, decontamination, communications) that degrade over time and must be maintained.</div>
        </div>
        <div class="help-row">
          <div class="help-key">Success</div>
          <div>You earn credits by processing ships and surviving your shift. One critical mistake: approving a hazardous ship, running out of fuel, losing all relays — will SEVER your gate connection. GAME OVER. Your shift officially ends at your chosen duration, but you can continue indefinitely if you stay vigilant.</div>
        </div>
        <div class="help-row">
          <div class="help-key">What is Severing?</div>
          <div>When your gate loses power, communications fail completely, or a catastrophic event occurs, the gate SEVERS from the network. This ends your session. All severing conditions are preventable if you maintain systems and check ships carefully.</div>
        </div>
      </div>
      <div class="help-section">
        <div class="help-section-title">2. Your Interface</div>
        <div class="help-row">
          <div class="help-key">Top Bar</div>
          <div>Shows your operator callsign (editable), gate ID, current credits earned, shift time, and alert count. The right side has controls for theme, sound, visual effects, HELP, and RESET (danger — wipes your session).</div>
        </div>
        <div class="help-row">
          <div class="help-key">TRAFFIC Panel</div>
          <div>Two queues: INBOUND (ships arriving at your gate) and OUTBOUND (ships departing from your gate). Each ship shows ID, priority, type, cargo, status, and action buttons (DTL, QRY, DECON, APP, DENY). Ships with CRITICAL priority have strict deadlines — missing them can SEVER your gate.</div>
        </div>
        <div class="help-row">
          <div class="help-key">SYSTEMS Panel</div>
          <div>Monitors your gate's health across 7 subsections: Gate Systems (beacon, alignment, sync), Corridor Systems (transit links to other gates), Facility Systems (decon bay, fuel manifold, dock clamps), Resources (fuel and supply levels), Concourse & Docks (current ship population), Relays (communication network), and Maintenance (active work orders). Systems have three states: ONLINE, DEGRADED (yellow), or OFFLINE.</div>
        </div>
        <div class="help-row">
          <div class="help-key">TERMINAL Panel</div>
          <div>Bottom section with two parts: Console Log (command output), and Command Input (where you type commands like STATUS or APPROVE V-9012). Four maintenance buttons sit above the input: REALIGN, RESYNC, PURGE, SCAN.</div>
        </div>
      </div>
      <div class="help-section">
        <div class="help-section-title">3. What You Do First</div>
        <div class="help-row">
          <div class="help-key">First 2 Minutes</div>
          <div>
            <ol class="help-list">
              <li>Ships may appear in TRAFFIC immediately. Check for CRITICAL ships (marked with a star) first.</li>
              <li>Check your gate SYSTEMS, CORRIDOR LINKS and RELAYS for any issues.</li>
              <li>Look for warnings in red text and check the console for initial updates.</li>
              <li>If a ship is clean (no hazards, valid transponder), click APP (Approve). If hazardous, click DENY.</li>
              <li>Use the MAINTENANCE buttons to fix any initial SYSTEMS issues.</li>
            </ol>
          </div>
        </div>
        <div class="help-row">
          <div class="help-key">Basic Loop</div>
          <div>Process ships as they arrive, monitor system health, acknowledge relay pings, order fuel and supplies when low, repair degraded facilities. The game never pauses. Systems degrade randomly. Ships keep coming.</div>
        </div>
      </div>
      <div class="help-section">
        <div class="help-section-title">4. Ship Management</div>
        <div class="help-row">
          <div class="help-key">APPROVE (APP)</div>
          <div>Clears a ship for transit through your gate. You earn credits. Ship enters the Concourse and docks. <strong>WARNING:</strong> Approving an INBOUND ship with VACUUM BLOOM, RAIDERS, or PIRATES will <strong>INSTANTLY SEVER YOUR GATE</strong> and end the game.</div>
        </div>
        <div class="help-row">
          <div class="help-key">DENY</div>
          <div>Refuses ship entry/exit. Denying hazardous ships earns credits. Denying non-hazardous ships costs credits — a strategic tradeoff when you prioritize safety over profit. Denying won't end your game (unless it's a 'safe' CRITICAL or PRIORITY ship), but approving the wrong ship will.</div>
        </div>
        <div class="help-row">
          <div class="help-key">HOLD</div>
          <div>Pauses a ship for 30-60 seconds. Use this when you need time to investigate, run SCAN, or QUERY a ship. Each ship can only be held ONCE. Use it wisely.</div>
        </div>
        <div class="help-row">
          <div class="help-key">QUERY (QRY)</div>
          <div>Requests ship identification and clears UNKNOWN fields. Use on ships with UNKNOWN sections or MISMATCH transponder status. Ship will respond after a delay. Some ships won't respond or may mask their signal. Use SCAN to dig deeper, but it may be risky.</div>
        </div>
        <div class="help-row">
          <div class="help-key">DECON</div>
          <div>Starts decontamination procedure. Ships with CORRIDOR RADIATION must be denied if outbound; you cannot decon outbound ships safely. Requires DECON BAY facility to be ONLINE. Costs supply.</div>
        </div>
        <div class="help-row">
          <div class="help-key">DETAIL (DTL)</div>
          <div>Shows complete ship information: ID, state, cargo, transponder status, priority level, effects/hazards, notes, ETA, dock slot. <strong>ALWAYS CHECK DETAIL BEFORE APPROVING.</strong> One missed hazard = instant game over.</div>
        </div>
        <div class="help-row">
          <div class="help-key">Ship Hazards Reference</div>
          <div>
            <table style="width:100%; border-collapse: collapse; margin-top: 0.5em;">
              <tr style="border-bottom: 1px solid currentColor;">
                <th style="text-align:left; padding: 0.25em;">Hazard</th>
                <th style="text-align:left; padding: 0.25em;">Where</th>
                <th style="text-align:left; padding: 0.25em;">Correct Action</th>
                <th style="text-align:left; padding: 0.25em;">If Wrong</th>
              </tr>
              <tr>
                <td style="padding: 0.25em;">Vacuum Bloom</td>
                <td style="padding: 0.25em;">Inbound</td>
                <td style="padding: 0.25em;">DENY: QUARANTINE REQUIRED</td>
                <td style="padding: 0.25em;"><strong>GAME OVER</strong></td>
              </tr>
              <tr>
                <td style="padding: 0.25em;">Corridor Radiation</td>
                <td style="padding: 0.25em;">Outbound</td>
                <td style="padding: 0.25em;">DENY: RADIATION HAZARD</td>
                <td style="padding: 0.25em;"><strong>GAME OVER</strong></td>
              </tr>
              <tr>
                <td style="padding: 0.25em;">Raiders / Pirates</td>
                <td style="padding: 0.25em;">Any</td>
                <td style="padding: 0.25em;">DENY: AUTHORITIES NOTIFIED</td>
                <td style="padding: 0.25em;"><strong>GAME OVER</strong></td>
              </tr>
              <tr>
                <td style="padding: 0.25em;">MISMATCH transponder</td>
                <td style="padding: 0.25em;">Any</td>
                <td style="padding: 0.25em;">QUERY first, then decide</td>
                <td style="padding: 0.25em;">Risk of hidden threat</td>
              </tr>
              <tr>
                <td style="padding: 0.25em;">UNKNOWN transponder</td>
                <td style="padding: 0.25em;">Any</td>
                <td style="padding: 0.25em;">QUERY + SCAN recommended</td>
                <td style="padding: 0.25em;">Risk of hidden threat</td>
              </tr>
              <tr style="border-bottom: 1px solid currentColor;">
                <td style="padding: 0.25em;">Hidden threats</td>
                <td style="padding: 0.25em;">Any</td>
                <td style="padding: 0.25em;">Use SCAN to detect</td>
                <td style="padding: 0.25em;">Approve unknowingly = disaster</td>
              </tr>
            </table>
          </div>
        </div>
        <div class="help-row">
          <div class="help-key">Outbound Deadlines</div>
          <div>Outbound ships have departure deadlines (countdown timers). CRITICAL priority ships must be processed quickly - missing their deadline will SEVER your gate. URGENT ships cause credit penalties if delayed. STANDARD ships are lower risk but still cost credits if you miss their window.</div>
        </div>
      </div>
      <div class="help-section">
        <div class="help-section-title">5. Systems Maintenance</div>
        <div class="help-row">
          <div class="help-key">Beacon</div>
          <div>Status: ONLINE / FAULT / OFFLINE. Your gate's visibility signal to the network. If OFFLINE, other gates can't see you and fewer ships will arrive. No direct fix — use RESYNC command which can sometimes restore it. Degrades randomly.</div>
        </div>
        <div class="help-row">
          <div class="help-key">Alignment</div>
          <div>Status: WITHIN TOLERANCE / DRIFTING / OUT OF TOLERANCE. Gate positioning accuracy for safe transit. If OUT OF TOLERANCE, ships cannot transit safely. <strong>Fix:</strong> Type REALIGN command or click REALIGN button (10-second cooldown). Use preventively when showing DRIFTING.</div>
        </div>
        <div class="help-row">
          <div class="help-key">Sync</div>
          <div>Status: SYNC / ASYNC / FAULT. Network synchronization state. If FAULT, gate connection becomes unstable and may lead to severing. <strong>Fix:</strong> Type RESYNC command or click RESYNC button (10-second cooldown). Healthy relays also help maintain sync. If ALIGNMENT is OUT OF TOLERANCE or SYNC is FAULT for 60s, the gate SEVERS (klaxon at 30s).</div>
        </div>
        <div class="help-row">
          <div class="help-key">Corridors (Links)</div>
          <div>Status: STABLE / DEGRADED / INTERMITTENT / OFFLINE. Transit paths connecting your gate to others (usually 3-4 links labeled A, B, C, D). Like highways between cities. If <strong>ALL corridors go OFFLINE</strong>, your gate loses network connection and <strong>SEVERS (GAME OVER)</strong>. No direct fix — corridors degrade and recover randomly. Maintain overall gate health to reduce risk.</div>
        </div>
        <div class="help-row">
          <div class="help-key">Facilities</div>
          <div>Status: ONLINE / DEGRADED / OFFLINE. Gate station equipment (DECON BAY for decontamination, FUEL MANIFOLD for refueling, DOCK CLAMP ARRAY for docking, BEACON AMPLIFIER for signal strength, etc.). <strong>WARNING:</strong> DEGRADED facilities automatically fail to OFFLINE after 2-5 minutes if not repaired. If <strong>ALL facilities are OFFLINE</strong> with no active work orders, gate <strong>SEVERS (GAME OVER)</strong>. Different facilities being offline will have different impacts on gameplay.</div>
        </div>
        <div class="help-row">
          <div class="help-key">Repairing Facilities</div>
          <div><strong>Option 1 (Quick):</strong> Type REPAIR [system name] or click REPAIR button. 70% success rate, instant if successful, 5-second cooldown. On failure, the system usually stays degraded; a failed repair can still knock it offline. Each REPAIR attempt costs supply. <strong>Option 2 (Guaranteed):</strong> Click WO (Work Order) button. 100% success, takes 1-3 minutes, costs supply. Issue work orders on critical facilities to guarantee repair.</div>
        </div>
        <div class="help-row">
          <div class="help-key">Relays</div>
          <div>Status: ONLINE / WEAK / FAULT / OFFLINE. Communication stations (2-3 per gate, labeled R-XXXX) that maintain your connection to the network. Relays periodically send PING requests. <strong>You MUST click ACK or type ACK [relay-id] within 5 seconds</strong> of a relay ping. Missed ACKs damage relay health by 25-40%. If <strong>ALL relays go OFFLINE</strong> for 10+ seconds, gate <strong>SEVERS (GAME OVER)</strong>. Enable audio to hear ping alerts. Use STABILIZE for maintenance, RESTORE for repairs.</div>
        </div>
        <div class="help-row">
          <div class="help-key">Relay Commands</div>
          <div>ACK [relay-id]: Acknowledge relay ping (CRITICAL! Do this ASAP!). PING [relay-id]: Test relay connection manually. STABILIZE [relay-id]: Proactive maintenance for ONLINE/WEAK relays, +10-20% health, 3min cooldown. RESTORE [relay-id]: Repair degraded relays, success rate based on relay health (92% for ONLINE, 50% for CRITICAL).</div>
        </div>
        <div class="help-row">
          <div class="help-key">FUEL</div>
          <div>Drains continuously, when it reaches 25% or less it will show CRITICAL warning. <strong>At 0% your gate loses power and SEVERS (GAME OVER)</strong>. <strong>Fix:</strong> Click ORDER buttons under Resources or type ORDER FUEL [amount] (e.g., ORDER FUEL 50). Costs credits, takes time to deliver. <strong>Order fuel at 30-40%, not when critical.</strong></div>
        </div>
        <div class="help-row">
          <div class="help-key">SUPPLY</div>
          <div>Used for work orders, decontamination operations, and REPAIR attempts. Doesn't drain passively. Running out means you cannot issue work orders or decon ships. <strong>Fix:</strong> Click ORDER buttons or type ORDER SUPPLY [amount]. Order supply when below 30% if you have active maintenance needs.</div>
        </div>
        <div class="help-row">
          <div class="help-key">Progression</div>
          <div>You can purchase additional <strong>RELAYS</strong> and <strong>DOCKING SLOTS</strong> during longer sessions. Click PURCHASE buttons in their respective panels or type PURCHASE RELAY / PURCHASE DOCK. Cost increases with each purchase. Requires credits (CR) and SUPPLY. New items require 2-3 minutes to assemble before becoming operational.</div>
        </div>
        <div class="help-row">
          <div class="help-key">Concourse</div>
          <div>Shows current ship population at your gate. Increases when you approve ships, decreases over time. High concourse levels raise the chance of facility subsystems degrading. <strong>Fix:</strong> Type PURGE command or click PURGE button to clear low-priority traffic from the ship queue (costs 10 FUEL, 10-second cooldown).</div>
        </div>
      </div>
      <div class="help-section">
        <div class="help-section-title">6. Commands You'll Need</div>
        <div class="help-row">
          <div class="help-key">Essential Commands</div>
          <div>
            SYS — Show overall gate health summary<br>
            SHIFT — Show shift summary, time remaining, wage.<br>
            DETAIL [ship-id] — View ship details (e.g., DETAIL V-9012)<br>
            MANIFEST [ship-id] — View crew manifest of a specific ship (e.g., MANIFEST V-9012)<br>
            APPROVE [ship-id] — Clear ship for transit (e.g., APPROVE V-9012)<br>
            DENY [ship-id] — Refuse ship (e.g., DENY V-9012)<br>
            SCAN — Detect hidden hazards on ships and reveal info more often than QUEREY. <strong>USE WITH CAUTION - CAN DISRUPT ALIGNMENT, RELAYS AND SYNC STATE!</strong><br>
            REALIGN — Fix gate alignment (10s cooldown)<br>
            RESYNC — Fix sync issues (10s cooldown)<br>
            PURGE — Clear ship queue congestion (costs 10 FUEL, 10s cooldown)<br>
            ACK [relay-id] — Acknowledge relay ping (e.g., ACK R-7701) CRITICAL<br>
            REPAIR [system] — Quick repair facility (e.g., REPAIR DECON BAY)<br>
            ORDER FUEL [amount] — Buy fuel (e.g., ORDER FUEL 50)<br>
            ORDER SUPPLY [amount] — Buy supplies (e.g., ORDER SUPPLY 30)<br>
            PURCHASE RELAY — Buy additional relay (costs CR + SUPPLY)<br>
            PURCHASE DOCK — Buy additional docking slot (costs CR + SUPPLY)
          </div>
        </div>
        <div class="help-row">
          <div class="help-key">Info Commands</div>
          <div>
            HELP or ? — Show command list<br>
            LINKS — View corridor status<br>
            LIST or LIST INBOUND or LIST OUTBOUND or LIST DOCKED — List ships in queues<br>
            RELAYS — Show relay network status and pending ACKs<br>
            PACKETS — Show recent transmission activity<br>
            WORKORDER [system] — Issue guaranteed work order for facility
          </div>
        </div>
        <div class="help-row">
          <div class="help-key">Ship Commands</div>
          <div>
            DETAIL [id] — Full ship information<br>
            QUERY [id] — Request ship identification<br>
            HOLD [id] — Pause ship for 30-60s (one-time use per ship)<br>
            DECON [id] or DECON START [id] — Start decontamination<br>
            NOTE [id] [text] — Add operator notes to ship record
          </div>
        </div>
        <div class="help-row">
          <div class="help-key">Relay Commands</div>
          <div>
            ACK [relay-id] — Acknowledge relay ping (MUST DO WITHIN 5 SECONDS)<br>
            PING [relay-id] — Test relay connection<br>
            RESTORE [relay-id] — Attempt to repair FAULT/WEAK relay
          </div>
        </div>
        <div class="help-row">
          <div class="help-key">Utility Commands</div>
          <div>
            THEME [color] — Change color (green/red/blue/purple/amber/cyan/orange/black/light)<br>
            SFX or SFX ON|OFF|TOGGLE — Control sound effects<br>
            MUSIC or MUSIC ON|OFF|TOGGLE — Control background music<br>
            VFX or VFX REG|LOW|TOGGLE — Control visual effects<br>
            CLEAR — Clear console text<br>
            ZOOM [up/down/reset/N%] — Adjust text size
          </div>
        </div>
				<div class="help-row">
          <div class="help-key">GATE NETWORK (Multiplayer) Commands</div>
          <div>
            MSG [message] — Send a message to the GATE NETWORK<br>
            ACTIVE — Display connected Gate operators<br>
            PING GATE-ID — Ping another GATE OPERATOR<br>
            ACK GATE-ID — Acknowledge a ping from other GATE OPERATORS<br>
            DND PING|MSG|ALL — Toggle Do Not Disturb mode for Messages, Pings, or both
          </div>
        </div>
        <div class="help-row">
          <div class="help-key">Quick Keys</div>
          <div>Enter — Submit command. ArrowUp — Recall last command. Esc — Clear input or dismiss this panel.</div>
        </div>
      </div>
      <div class="help-section">
        <div class="help-section-title">7. How You Lose (SEVERING)</div>
        <div class="help-row">
          <div class="help-key">1. FUEL DEPLETION</div>
          <div>FUEL reaches 0% → Power loss → <strong>SEVERED</strong>. Why: You didn't order fuel in time or ran out of credits. Prevention: Order fuel when below 30%, keep credits available, monitor fuel constantly.</div>
        </div>
        <div class="help-row">
          <div class="help-key">2. RELAY FAILURE</div>
          <div>All relays offline for 10+ seconds → Network disconnected → <strong>SEVERED</strong>. Why: You ignored relay PING requests or didn't ACK them within 5 seconds. Prevention: ACK relay pings IMMEDIATELY when they appear. Enable audio to hear ping alerts. Use STABILIZE and RESTORE when available to repair RELAYS. LAST RESORT: If all relays go offline, spam-click the BROADCAST button to extend the timer (+1.5s per click) until a relay recovers.</div>
        </div>
        <div class="help-row">
          <div class="help-key">3. CORRIDOR COLLAPSE</div>
          <div>All corridor links offline → Lost network connection → <strong>SEVERED</strong>. Why: Degraded into OFFLINE and you did not use REALIGN. Prevention: Use REALIGN to realign corridor links.</div>
        </div>
        <div class="help-row">
          <div class="help-key">4. FACILITY FAILURE</div>
          <div>All four facilities offline → System failure → <strong>SEVERED</strong>. Why: You let facilities degrade from DEGRADED to OFFLINE (happens in 2-5 min) without repairing them. Prevention: Issue work orders or use REPAIR command when facilities show DEGRADED.</div>
        </div>
        <div class="help-row">
          <div class="help-key">5. VACUUM BLOOM</div>
          <div>Approved ship with Vacuum Bloom reaches gate or departs to a populated area → Outbreak → <strong>INSTANT SEVERED</strong>. Why: You approved a hazardous ship without checking DETAIL. Prevention: ALWAYS check ship DETAIL before approving. DENY any ship with Vacuum Bloom.</div>
        </div>
        <div class="help-row">
          <div class="help-key">6. RAIDERS/PIRATES</div>
          <div>Approved ship with Raiders or Pirates reaches gate → Attack → <strong>INSTANT SEVERED</strong>. Why: You approved hostile ships. Prevention: Use SCAN command cautiously to detect hidden threats. DENY when detected.</div>
        </div>
        <div class="help-row">
          <div class="help-key">7. RADIATION EXPOSURE</div>
          <div>Approved outbound ship with Corridor Radiation departs → Gate exposure → <strong>INSTANT SEVERED</strong>. Why: You let a contaminated ship depart from your gate. Prevention: DECON inbound ships with radiation before approval. DENY any outbound ship showing radiation with reason "RADIATION HAZARD".</div>
        </div>
        <div class="help-row">
          <div class="help-key">8. CRITICAL DEADLINES AND DENIALS</div>
          <div>Failed to process CRITICAL or PRIORITY ship on time OR wrongfully denied a CRITICAL or PRIORITY ship → Ship lost → <strong>INSTANT SEVERED</strong>. Why: You didn't prioritize or wrongfully denied high-urgency ships. Prevention: Process CRITICAL priority ships first, watch countdown timers, use HOLD if you need time to verify safety. Ensure that you approve all CRITICAL ships and have DOCKS available for INBOUND CRITICAL ships.</div>
        </div>
        <div class="help-row">
          <div class="help-key">9. ENTERING DEBT</div>
          <div>Reaching 0 (or less) total wage after an action that costs CR (incorrect approvals/denies, spending on resources, etc) → <strong>INSTANT SEVERED</strong>. Why: You didn't manage your incoming wage versus spending or made too many small mistakes that added up to cost you in the end. Keep an eye on WAGE and be careful!</div>
        </div>
				<div class="help-row">
          <div class="help-key">10. BACKLOGGED TRAFFIC</div>
          <div>Approved too many ships → More than THREE regular ships "Waiting to Dock" OR more than ONE CRITICAL/PRIORITY ship "Waiting to Dock" → <strong>INSTANT SEVERED</strong>. Why: You managed ship traffic poorly. CRITICAL/PRIORITY ships (marked with ★) are more important and cannot be left waiting. Prevention: Prioritize docking CRITICAL ships first. Use PURGE (-10 fuel) to clear the queue of non-critical ships, or DENY incoming non-critical ships and take the minor hit to WAGE if you can afford it. Make sure your DECON BAY and FUEL MANIFOLD stay ONLINE so ships go through docking faster.</div>
        </div>
			  <div class="help-row">
          <div class="help-key">11. CRITICAL SYSTEMS FAILURE</div>
          <div>ALIGNMENT becomes OUT OF ALIGNMENT or SYNC STATE becomes FAULT → 60 seconds pass, alarm sounding at 20 → Ignored for too long → <strong>INSTANT SEVERED</strong>. Why: Critical GATE SYSTEMS failed and were not fixed. Prevention: use REALIGN to fix ALIGNMENT, bringing it back up to "WITHIN TOLERANCE". Use RESYNC to fix SYNC STATE back to "SYNC" - if RELAYS are down, SYNC STATE may be stuck in ASYNC.</div>
        </div>
      </div>
      <div class="help-section">
        <div class="help-section-title">8. Tips for Survival</div>
        <div class="help-row">
          <div class="help-key">Critical Habits</div>
          <div>
            <ul class="help-list">
              <li>Check DETAIL on EVERY ship if you're not CERTAIN approving. One hazard missed = instant game over.</li>
              <li>ACK relay pings IMMEDIATELY when they appear. Set audio ON to hear alerts.</li>
              <li>Order FUEL when below 40%, not when critical. Fuel takes time to deliver.</li>
              <li>Repair facilities at DEGRADED status. Don't wait for OFFLINE (harder to fix).</li>
              <li>Watch outbound ship deadlines. CRITICAL priority ships can SEVER your gate if missed.</li>
              <li>When in doubt, use HOLD to pause a ship, then SCAN and DETAIL to investigate.</li>
              <li>Incorrect DENYs cost credits but won't end your game. Incorrect APPROVEs will.</li>
              <li>Use REALIGN and RESYNC preventively (10s cooldowns). PURGE costs 10 FUEL.</li>
              <li>Use SCAN cautiously but as needed. It can reveal hazards and UNKNOWNS significantly better than QUEREY; but it often will degrade or impact systems.</li>
              <li>You earn credits per minute + credits per action. </li>
            </ul>
          </div>
        </div>
        <div class="help-row">
          <div class="help-key">Save/Load</div>
          <div>EXPORT downloads a .tqegate save file. LOAD FILE restores a saved session. Use these to preserve long successful shifts.</div>
        </div>
        <div class="help-row">
          <div class="help-key">Interface Settings</div>
          <div>THEME changes colors (12 options). SFX/MUSIC toggle audio (recommend ON for relay ping alerts). VFX toggles visual effects (use LOW on low performance devices). RESET button (top right) wipes your session completely.</div>
        </div>
      </div>
		  <div class="help-section">
        <div class="help-section-title">9. Final Notes</div>
        <div class="help-row">
          <div class="help-key">Keep In Mind:</div>
          <div>As you learn the game, you will often experience SEVERS. Each GATE SEVER presents you with the reason that caused the SEVER; allowing you to learn from your mistakes.</div>
        </div>
				<div class="help-row">
          <div class="help-key">Unlockables and Achievements:</div>
          <div>With each shift, your stats are recorded in the PROFILE tab. You can unlock achievements and milestones based on your actions. Completing a shift of 1 hour guarauntees a new theme unlock. Each additional hour adds a chance of additional themes.</div>
